<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Mbugu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mburi Kulho igondiwe ni Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mburi Kulho sakigi igondiwe ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mariko</para>
  <para style="imt">Chikaeye</para>
  <para style="ip">Mburi Kulho igondiwe ni Mariko niwe ya vitabu vihai viaha he Iaghano ikua liyoiya mizokhoire yakwe Yesu Kiristo. Kira kitabu kiwe chisewe Injili nikuba, “Mburi Kulho.” Ka vitabu vyeegondiwe ni Matayo ne Mariko ne Luka ne Yohana ata Yesu areakhwa agaa. Ya kitabu chakwe Mariko ni kigitutu heka vitabu vihali vihai. Vahe vedarisha ite ya kitabu nicho chilholhoshie kugondwa kuro vihali. Cheegondiwe he miko sitini sari sitini na koi Yesu areakhwa aahoika. Vasomi vakumure veilie ite chigondiwe are Rumi kalo kuvabutu swaho hu vahe vemdarisha Kiristo veaha are Rumi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mariko naho eilike se Yohana Mariko, eekuliahana ne Paulo ne Barnaba, mira ukulho kuu teuakhoikane ite uraye areakugu he bari kini ya bosi ya yakubirikira Mburi Kulho,naho Mariko ekaso hawe ne Barnaba sacho chigondiwe he Miboire 15:37-39. Naho Mariko eelo usaho wa sina ne Petro, 1 Petro 5:13. Heya kita Mariko etayoisha he mburi ya kukhwa mhina wakwe Yesu na mahinyo yakwe Yesu eaija mburi ya madamo ya mkhito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeata za</para>
  <para style="io">He Marko 1:1-13 etayoiya Kitabu kuu ite chikhwaemo</para>
  <para style="io">Naho he Mariko 1:14-8:21, etayoya nyamalo jakwe Yesu eaha he idi la Galilaya</para>
  <para style="io">Niho he Mariko 8:22-10:52, etayoya bari yakwe Yesu kuso Yerusalemu Galilaya 1:14-8:21</para>
  <para style="io">He Mariko 11:1-16:8 Marko ekafiriti kwakugonda miaze yakwe Yesu eeaha are Yerusalemu, kigame hawe na kuka kuli he kigame.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana mzabatija etavabirikiria vahe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:19-28">1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ya niu kulholhoshi kwa Mburi Kulho jakwe Yesu Kiristo, Mburatu wakwe Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Chilholhoshie sakigi chigondiwe he kitabu chakwe Isaya mroto wa Kiumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Kiumbi eebaye, Ninemsugha mzasughawa gho akukaeye, u enekuboiya balabala kechi.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Kiome cha mhechise are he ilangwa chikuba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Mboiyeni Dilao kwalhi kuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Ikuuruni kikulho kwalhi enetakho.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohana Mzabatija eelitie he ilangwa ekabirikira ite, “Vahe vayo makusa kini na kuyaro, naho vabatijwe kalo Kiumbi avakaaie makusa kini.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Vahe vakumure kuli he idi la Yudea na kuli he muang'a wa Yerusalemu vakhabuna vekaso hakuu. Vekadumu ite velo makusa. Nau ekavabatija he muharaza Yoridani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana eekuoro gomae jiboiwe na mafoya ya Ngamia, eeoroe muowe wa bulhe hasi ya msa kuu, nu eekua naa ya maeza na mabalala. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yohana ekavabirikiria ekuba, “Elitie elo Ugiru kutakho ani. Ani siye neri kududukhu na kuge mulhu ja makwadoe kuu. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ani nimubatija na mai, mira u enemubatija kwa Saa wa Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etabatijwa na kugaliwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Yesu ekahe kuli muang'a wa Nazareti uaha he idi la Galilaya, ekabatijwa ni Yohana he muharaza Yoridani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu areaguijanya bi kuli za he mai, ekaakho are ana he Kiumbi helhaike, na Saa wa Kiumbi ekumdimia sakigi sua iradimi. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kiome kuli ana he Kiumbi chikakoika chikuba, “Ari ni Muinyi gho nikudumue, nayeiwa niari.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Wato oto Saa wa Kiumbi ekamkaeti kuso he ilangwa, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />ekafufu are maaze mikado mihai ekugaliwe ni Shetani. Nau eaha hawe na vimagheri vya maeza,na vanyamalo vaare ana he Kiumbi vekumnyamarikia.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavase vavuluji vahai kukhwa vahina kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Maaze makumure areatakho Yohana akalhatiwa he igereza, Yesu ekaso he muang'a wa Galilaya, kuzavabirikiria vahe Mburi Kulho ja Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />“Ekuba madamo yaahe,” “Udilao wa Kiumbi uaha sina. Yoni na kuro makusa kaghu na idarisheni Mburi Kulho!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu arekhwa etakho khakhera he iziwa la Galilaya, ekavaakho vazavula vanu, Simoni ne Andrea ne mbakhu kuu, vekuvulula samaki kwa nyavu. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu ekavaba, “Niliahani ani ninemuboi kune kuvagera vahe hagho sakigi mweekuvula samaki.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Wato oto vekaro nyavu kini, nakumliaha.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu areso hagitutu, ekavaakho Yakobo ne Yohana, vainyi vakwe Zebedayo, veaha za he mashua kini, vekuke kikulho nyavu kini. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Wato oto Yesu ekavase, navo vekamro Zebedayo aba kini he mashua hawe na vanyamalo, vekamliaha Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamgu mheipepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na vahina kuu vekahe he muang'a wa Kaperanahumu. Ureahe Muaze wa kusaaboi nyamalo, Yesu ekabuu he minda Vayahudi vesahe ekalholhoshi kuvahinya.<verse eid="MRK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Vahe vakhabuna vareamko vekamakisha kuhinya kuu, kwaite teekuhinya sa vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa, mira ehinya sa mheelo ugiru. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Wato oto he minda yo vesahe Vayahudi, heelo mhe elo ipepo, nau ekakhalaa, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />ekuba, “Udumu kiakhoni he nne, Yesu wa Nazareti? Tuba utelita kutugaa? Nikuilie ite ari niu usughawe ni Kiumbi!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Mira Yesu ekalijoghoiya ka ipepo ekuba, “Taa muli ya mhe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Niho ka ipepo likamkushisha ka muhe, naho ekakhaa, ipepo likamli. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Vahe vakhabuna vekamaka, vekalhasuana, “Ni mburi mina ya? Ya ni mahinyo magalho! Yelo ugiru, eyaba mapepo nau yamko.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Kwato mburi jakwe Yesu jikaparaa wangu kira he idi la Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti vahe vakumure</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wato oto vekahali he minda ya kusahe Vayahudi vekaso hawe ne Yakobo ne Yohana, vekaso we kwa we sari ang'a hakwe Simoni ne Andrea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Are mkora wa kilage wakwe Simoni, eebodie he muhasi elo ihoma, vekambaya Yesu nakawe mburi yaka mlage. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu ekamliaha kamlage ekamdara muharegha ekamkaa. Wato oto ekau, ekalholhoshi kuvaboiya nyamalo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Hachamakheri kaaze kareafili, vahe vekamgeria Yesu varukhao vakhabuna na vakhabuna velo mapepo. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Vahe vakhabuna he muang'a vekabunguru gahana he luhige lwa minda yakwe Simoni. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu ekavauti vahe vakumure veekuru marukho kini makhabuna na kuyagu mapepo makumure. Mira tevadumuije kuyo kigi kwaite yeremuile ite u niji.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etabirikiria vahe he idi la Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Kiama ama, kaaze kesinali, Yesu ekaka, ekaso hodi hesilo vahe, kuraaresi. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na vaaro kini vekaso kuramdaa. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Vareamuakho vekamba, “Kira mhe ekudaa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu ekavaba, “Tudumuwe tuso he miang'a mihali isiaha uda. Are nidumuwe nizebirikiria vahe Mburi Kulho, kwaite ka nyamalo niu inigerie.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Kwato Yesu, ekaso kira hagi are Galilaya, ilai ekuvabirikiria vahe he minda ja kusaheya Vayahudi na kugu mapepo.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mheelo urukhao wa mkwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Mhe muwe eekuru urukhao wa bulhe ekamliaha Yesu, ekama mamuro, ekamlhawa, “Ukudumu,” Ekamba “Umuru kuniboi nidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi!”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu ekamkoiya mbalamija ka mhe, ekakuuruti muharegha kuu ekamdara ka mhe ekamba, “Nidumu” “Nidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Wato oto ekau urukhao wa lukoma, ekadumuijwa kumuaresi Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Niho, Yesu ekamlhiijisha ekamba aso, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />eembae “Usiregali kumbaya mhe ya mburi, mira uso urekuajia he mgiru wa muaresi, naho uregu kivulu kwa kudumuijwa kumuaresi Kiumbi sakigi Musa eajie. Naho mgiru wa muaresi akuaije he vahe vakhabuna ite wadumuijwa kumuaresi Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Mira ka mhe ekaso, ekalholhoshi kuyo ka mburi kira hagi na kuparati ka mburi kumure jikamuboi Yesu akwasiwe kubuu he muang'a kwa kuilika. Kwato Yesu ekazokho hagi hesilo vahe. Mira vahe vekamliaha kuli kira hagi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mheeholoje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Maaze esi makumure aretakho, Yesu ekakirii Kapernaumu, vahe vekako ite eaha he minda yo ekufufu. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Niho, vahe vakumure vekabunguru za he minda, hekakhwa tehelo neri hakutakhoya kwaite vahe veehuye sari gahana. Yesu ekakhwa etavabirikiria Mburi Kulho. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Wato oto vekahe vahe vahai, vemtiiye mheeholoje kalo Yesu amuuti. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kwaite vahe ne vakumure, vekakwasiwe kumtii hagi Yesu eaha. Vekabovora ana heminda vekambuija ka mheeebodie he mhasi hodi Yesu eaha . <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu areaakho kudarisha kini, ekamba ka mheeholoje, “Muinyi gho, wakaaiwa makusa kechi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Vahinya vakuwe va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa veezokhodie veekutoti he swaho kini, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ya mhe emuru kimomo kuyo to? Etamuolhu Kiumbi! Tehelo mhe emuru kukaa makusa ya muhe, kuro Kiumbi bi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Wato oto Yesu ekaila chovetoti he swaho kini, ekavaba, “Kwakhoni mutoti to?” <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ho ni kihama chimanga muruika, kumbaiya mheya eholoje, “Wakaiwa makusa kechi, hile kumba, ka dori katandiko kechi uso. <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kwato, Yesu ekamba hu mheeholoje, nidumu muile ite heya idi, Muinyi wa Muhe niu emuru kuvakaiya vahe makusa kini.”<verse eid="MRK 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nakubao ka, dori mhasi kechi uso ang'a kechi!” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Wato oto vahe vemuwesie ekauma ekadori mhasi kuu, ekaso, vahe vakhabuna vekamaka ilai vemfaruia Kiumbi, vekuba, “Neri tetunaraakho kimako saya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamlhoja Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu ekaso kahali kakhera he iziwa la Galilaya. Ifyo la vahe vakumure vekamliaha, nau ekalholhoshi kuvahinya. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Areakhwa etakho, ekamuakho Lawi muinyi wakwe Alfayo, ezokhodie hagi hakudaraya kodi. Yesu ekamba, “Niliaha!” Lawi ekauma, ekamliaha.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Niho Yesu arekhwa ezokhodie ea viaghu ang'a hakwe Lawi, Vedori kodi vakumure hawe na velo makusa veekua hawe nau, kwaite vahe veekumliaha nee vakumure. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Vahinya vakuwe va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa ne Mafarisayo, varemuakho Yesu ekua na velo makusa na vedaria kodi, vekavalhasu vahina kuu, “Kwakhoni ea na velo makusa na vedoria kodi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu areako to, ekavaba, “Vahe vesiru tevedaa mkura, mira vedaa mkura nihu varukhao. Silitie kwamburi ya vesilo makusa, mira nilitiye kwamburi ya velo makusa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi ya kulhati kua viaghu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Vahina vakwe Yohana na vahina va Mafarisayo veekulhati kua viaghu. Vahe vahali vekalita kumlhasu Yesu, “Kwakhoni vahina vakwe Yohana na vahina va Mafarisayo velhati kua viaghu, mira vahina kechi tevelhati kua viaghu?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu ekavalhasu, ho veiriwe he ela ya mzadori vemuru kimomo kulhati kua viaghu ilai veaha hawe na mzadori? Hai tevemuru kulhati kua viaghu. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Mira madamo enehe mzadori enekaawe he vo, ata niho venelhati kua viaghu.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Tehelo mheepaa kilaka he gomae kuale na kuchihi he gomae ialalue, ekuboi to, kilaka kikuale chineoni gomae ya azeto, naka gomae ialalue inesaisha kukhaika. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kahali tehelo mheebutu divai kuale he kishau cha ya bulhe ialalue. Kai ekuboi to, divai kuale ineibovora ka mifuko ya bulhe, divai inesuika na mifuko ya bulhe ineonika. mira divai kuale ibutuwe he mifuko ya bulhe mikuale.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muaze wa kusaboi nyamalo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Muaze muwe wa kufufu, Yesu na vahina kuu veekutakho he mbuva ja ngano. Vareakhwa vedaha, Vahina kuu vekalholhoshi kupu vireri vya ngano kalo vaa. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafarisayo vekamlhasu Yesu, “Wesia veboi mburi ilhiijwe kuboiwa Muaze wa kufufu?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu ekavakheriti, “Ho temusomie cho Dilao Daudi na vaaro kuu veboie to veelo kela, <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />ata Abiatari ee mgiru wa mzaaresija wa Kiumbi, Daudi ekabuu he minda ya Kiumbi, ekaa mikate iguwe he Kiumbi. Mikate ka yeedumuiwe iawe ni vagiru va muaresi va Kiumbi bi, mira Daudi ekaia kahali ekavao na vaaro kuu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Niho, Yesu ekavaba, “Muaze wakufufu wekeiwe kwa mburi ya vahe si vahe kwa mburi ya Muaze wakufufu. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kwato, Muinyi wa Muhe niu Dilao emuru vikhabuna neri kutakho Muaze wa kufufu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mheelo muharegha uholoje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Niho, Yesu ekabuu kahali he minda yo vesahe Vayahudi, are heelo mhe elo muharegha uholoje. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ataza vahe vakuwe veaha veekudaa mburi ya kumyoija, kwato vekamuwesia kai enemuuti mhe he Muaze wa kufufu. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu ekamba ka mheelo muharegha uholoje, “Lita ii kalo vahe vakhabuna vakuakho.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Niho, Yesu ekavalhasu, “Ho miku kanu jidumu tuboi akhoni Muaze wa kufufu? Ho, nikuboi makulho hile kuboi makusa? Ni kuuti hile kugaa?” Mira vo vekataa. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu ekavawesia ka vahe kwa malhaha, ekakuko kikusa he swaho kuu kwa kusadarisha kini. Niho, ekamba hu mhe, “Ukhuuru muharegha kechi!” Nau ekaukhuuru muharegha kuu, ukakhwa wau. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Waata ata, Mafarisayo vekali gahana, vekasahe na ifyo la vahe vakwe Herode vekadaa kwalhi ya kumgaa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifyo la vahe khakhera he iziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu hawe na vahina kuu veesoe khakhera he iziwa la Galilaya na ifyo la vahe vekamliaha, ka vahe velie Galilaya, Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />kuli Yerusalemu, Idumea, kuli hodi hahali hamlha wa kaaze keliiya wa mharaza Yoridani, he miang'a mikhabuna ijunguluka na Tiro na Sidoni. Ka maifyo makhabuna ya vahe veemliahe Yesu kwaite veekoie mburi khabuna jo ekujiboie. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kwaite heelo vahe vakumure, Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu vamdaaye mashua we, kalo vahe vakumure vasire mfinhafinha. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kwaite eevautie vahe vakumure, varukhao vakumure veekuhinkana kuso he Yesu kalo vamdara vautiwe marukho veekuru. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Vahe velo mapepo kira muwe areamuaho, eelhue mbere hei he Yesu ekakaa kiome ekuba, “Ari niu Muinyi wa Kiumbi!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Mira Yesu ekavalhiija ite vasiregali kuvabaya vahe ite u niji.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalhoja vahina ikhado na vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu ekakutu ana he lubwa, ekavase hu vo edumue, navo vekalita heu, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />ekavalhoija vahe ikhado na vanu hehu vahe evasee, ekavase vazasughawa. Ekavaba, “Nimulhoije kune muzokho na ani, kalo nimuru kumusugha kurabirikiria vahe mburi Kikulho, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kune ninemuo ugiru wa kugu mapepo.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Malhe ya vahe ikado na vanu velhoijwe ni Yesu, ne Simoni, ilhe ihali nee Petro, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobo ne Yohana, vainyi vakwe Zebedayo Yesu evaoe ya vabahu vanu ilhe la Boanige, ite “Vainyi va Lubambala”. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Vahali nee, Andrea ne Filipo ne Batolomayo ne Matayo ne Tomasi ne Yakobo muinyi wakwe Alfa ne Tadeo ne Simoni emaana kwa mburi idi kuu, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ne Yuda kuli muang'a wa Isikarioti, emlhiye Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etatotijwa ne Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Niho Yesu ekaso ho eekufufu. Ifyo igiru la vahe vekaburunguru kahali, sari Yesu na vahina kuu tevemuruye kua viaghu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Vabahu vakwe Yesu vareako to vekaso kuramdori kwaite veekuba, “Etaberi!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa velie Yerusalemu, vekaba, “Elo Belizebuli, mgiru wa mapepo, niu emuo ugiru wa kugu mapepo.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Niho Yesu ekavase vahe ekayo navo kwa mitotire ekuba, ho Shetani emuru kimomo kukuguluti salaghe? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ikukhwa vahe va udilao muwe vakakaana naho kumaana wanga u, ka udilao teukafufu. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ikukhwa bakhu ikakaana naho kumaana wanga u, ka ubakhu unega. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kwato ikukhwa, udilao wa Shetani unekakaana wanga u udilao kuu teukafufu na unekhwa niu mkhito kuu.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Tehelo mhe emuru kubuu he minda ya mhe elo u, naho amla mari kuu, ekudumu sari arongemuoro ka mhe, niho enemuru kumla mari kuu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Kweri nimubaiya, vahe venekaiwa makusa kini khabuna nahu vemuolhu Kiumbi, Kiumbi enevakaiya, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />mira hekusa mhe emuolhu Saa wa Kiumbi neri tekakaiwe makusa kuu, kwaite Kiumbi tekamukaaiye ka makusa maaze makabuna.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu eyoe to kwaite vahe veekuba, “Elo ipepo.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lage wakwe Yesu na vabakhu vakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Niho lage mkini Yesu na vabahu vakwe Yesu vekahe ata, vekauma gahana, vekasugha mheaso minda aremse Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ifyo la vahe vezokhodie kwa kumjunguluke Yesu, niho hu vahe vekamba, “Lage mkaghu na vabahu kechi veaha gahana, vekudaa ari.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “He lage gho ni ji? He, vabahu gho ni vaji?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ata ekavawesia ka vahe vemjunguluke, ekaba, “Ya nivo lage gho na vabahu gho. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Kira mheeboi mburi jo edumu Kiumbi nivo vainka na vaing'inha ne lage gho.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Chitotie na mzabibi mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu ekalholhoshi kuhinya kahali are kakera he iziwa la Galilaya. Ifyo igiru la vahe leemjunguluke ekaaho abuu he mashua na kuzokodi ata. Vahe kabuna vekakhwa vezokodie kakera he iziwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Evahinyie mburi kumure kwa mitotire, he mahinyo kuu ekavaba.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Lhahonaini mzabibi mbeyu muwe esoe kuzabibi mbeyu he mbuva. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Areakhwa ebibi mbeyu he mbuva, mbeyu hali jeelhue kwalhi, vuhimeno vukalita vukajia. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Mbeyu hali jeelhuie he ighamba, helo mpulhe usi mkumure. Ka mbeyu jikamangali kwaite teheelo mpulhe mkumure ana he ighamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Mira iaze lireasaisha, mbeyu jikanyuluka, kwaite majindo kuu teesoishe di, mbeyu ikahala. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbeyu hali jelhue he milhae, ka milhaei irelheru ikafinha ka mbeyu, kwato tejisae. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mira mbeyu hali jeelhue he mpule mkulho, mbeyu jikalheru jikasa mpuluzi, mbeyu we ikasa mhuluzi sarasini, we ikasa matizu na hali ikasa mia we.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Niho Yesu ekavaba, “Mhe elo malama ya kuko nako!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiroe ahinye kwa mitotire</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu areakhwa salaghe, vahina ikhado na vanu na vahe vahali veeaha hawe nau, vekamlhasu “Chiroe uhinya kwa mitotire ni kiakhoni?” <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kuni mwaaowe kuile mburi jikumatuwe he Udilao wa Kiumbi. Mira hu veaha gahana, vekoiya kira kigi kwa mitotire, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Kai venewesia, vawesie mira vasiakho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Kai veneko, vako mira vasiile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Kai veeilie, veseemuru kumkiriia Kiumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Nau esevakaaiya makusa kini.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayoiya mburi ya mtotire wa mzabibi mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Niho, Yesu ekavalhasu, “Ho kune temuilie mtotiano udumu kiakhoni? Iji, mnemuru kimomo, kuila neri mtotiano? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mbeyu ilhawe ni mzabibi ni Kiome cha Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Vahe vahali vetotiye na mpulhe uaha kwalhi. Vekuko bi kiome cha Kiumbi, Shetani etalita na kukaa ka kiome cha Kiumbi chiaha he swaho kini. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Vahe vahali vetotiye na mpulhe uaha he ighamba, vekuko kiome cha Kiumbi, vechidoria nakawe kwa kulhamuiwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Mira tevechibutu he swaho kini, kwaite vetotie na mbeyu jisilo majindo. Ka kiome vechidara madamo magitutu bi, madamo kharo jikuraliijanya kwaka kiome cha Kiumbi, vetaro kuchidarisha nakawe. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Vahe vahali vetotiye na mpulhe uaha he mikhatu ya milhae. Veko nakudoria kiome cha Kiumbi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />mira bughu ja mifufuire ya idi, kudumu mari na mhayo wa kudumu vigi vihali utabuu he swaho kini, na kuboi vahe vasimuru kudara kiome cha Kiumbi, na kuchiboiya nyamalo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Mira vahe vahali vetotiye sa hu mpulhe mkulho. Vo veko kiome cha Kiumbi, nakuchidaria na kusa matunda, we isa salasini, hali sitini na hali mia we.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotire wa Kijari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu ekacheri kuvalhasu, “Ho, mheekati kijari na kuchike za na kuchikubika kwa kore hile kuchike shanja? Hai! Echike ana he lushagha. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Kwaite, kira kigi chimatuwe chineahoika, na kira kigi chighubikwe chineghubulwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Elo malama ya kuko, ako!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Wato oto munevaboia vahe vahali, nirewato Kiumbi enemuboia kuni. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kwaite elo kigi enesusuwa kihali, mira esilo kigi, neri hu kigitutu cho elo nacho enelawa.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotire sa mbeyu ili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu ekacheri kuyo ekaba, “Udilao wa Kiumbi utotie sa mheelha mbeyu he mbuva. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ekufi kujilha, Naama etabodi, hachakako eaha maila, madamo ka mbeyu jitali na kulheru, neri u teila ite jilherue kimomo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Mpulhe salaghe ulhaari mbeyu kuli, kulheeru na kusa matunda, bosi itagu makhupi makenye, igu kireli, naho itasa. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mpuluzi jikuasi, niho mheeso na nyingo kurashumu, kwaite madamo yakulojwa yaahe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitotie na mbeyu ya haradali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu ekayo kahali ekaba, “Udilao wa Kiumbi tuutotije na kiakhoni? Tuusimoreje kwa utoti mina?” <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Utoe sa mbeyu ya haradali, mbeyu gitutu kuro mbeyu hali kabuna jilhawa he mbuva. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Mira ikulhawe italheru na kukhwa mhatu mgiru kutakho vikhabuna vilhawe he mbuva. Matambi kuu etakhwa magiru na vuhimeno vutalita kukwa mashasha kini ata.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu eyoe kwa mitotire mikumure, madamo ka ekuvabirikiria vahe, eeyoe navo sacho venemuru kuile. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Teyoe navo neri kigi esiyoe mtotire, mira eeaha na vahina kuu ekavabaya kira kigi kuli heka mitotire.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etailhiija nkunkunho ya mai giru isivumire</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Muaze wa kaa ka chamagheri, Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, “Tutakho tuso twai chauju he iziwa.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Niho vekaliro hu ifyo la vahe, vahina kuu vekabuu he mashua ho Yesu eaha vekaso nau, vahe vahali vekadori mashua hali vekamliaha. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Hekamangalita saa girusha hawe na nkunkunho ya mai ikaihinka hu mashua, mashua ikalholhoshi kuhu mai. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu eaha are mzungure he mashua eeie he kanagho, vahina vekamkaa na kumba, “Mhinya tuilie ite tutaga?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu ekaka, ekailhiija hu saa giru ekaiba “Uma!” “Ro” Saa ikauma na hekakhwa hakulho. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Niho, Yesu ekavalhasu vahina kuu, “Kwaakhoni mweebughenu? He, temunidarishe?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Vekabugheno, vekalhasuana, “Ya mhe niji, ekoiwa ni saa na nkunkunho ya mai!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mheelo ipepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na vahina kuu vekahe chaoju ya iziwa Galilaya he idi la vagerasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu areadimi bi he mashua ekasahe na mheelo ipepo elie hodi helo mbira. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ka mheeekuzokho helo mbira, tehelo neri mheeekumuru kumuoro kwa minyororo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Madamo makumure vemkumuoro miharegha na masame kwa mhingu na minyororo mira kira madamo ekuorowe etapaa ka minyororo na mhingu, teheelo neri mheelo u emurue kumlhiija. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Chakhako na naama ekudaha are he mbira na he lubwa, ekukaa kiome na kukuteete na masaheru.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Areamuakho Yesu kwa uda, ekamguguluiya, ekammaya mamuro na ekamdudukhuia, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />ekama lukhalasu, ekaba, “Ari Yesu Muinyi wa Kiumbi eaha Anasha, Udumu kunisamo ani? Nikugogo uke muo kwa ilhe la Kiumbi, nikulhawa usinio kharo!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Eyoe to kwaite Yesu eembaye, “Ari ipepo, muli ya mhe.”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Niho, Yesu emlhasu, “Ilhe kechi niji?” Nau ekaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">“Ilhe gho ni ifyo kwaite nne tuvakumure.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Niho likamgogo Yesu asiaguguluti hehu idi.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Sina na ata hakudimi he lubwa heelo ifyo igiru la gua jeekua. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Kwato, mapepo ekagogoe Yesu vekuba, “Tudumuje turebuu heka gua.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu ekaadumuja, ka mapepo ekali ekajibuia hu gua. Ifyo ikhabuna la gua jeerahe erufu nu likagugulu kudimi hehu lubwa sari he iziwa, jikabuu he iziwa jikafiri.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Vazemo vaka gua vekagugulu, vekayo ka mburi are he miang'a na vijiji. Vahe vekahe vareakho ka mburi jilijanye. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Hu vahe, vareahe he Yesu, vekamuakho wahuhu mheeelo ifyo la mapepo ezokhodie, eoroe gomae na elo akiri kulho vekabughenusha. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Vahe veeakhoye ka chilijanye, vekavabaya vahe vahali ka chimlianyije heka mheelo mapepo na mburi ya gua.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Niho, vekamba Yesu ahali he idi kini.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu ekukutu he mashua, hu mheeelo mapepo ekamgogo vaso hawe.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Mira Yesu ekamlhiija. Ekamba, “So ang'a he vabakhu kechi, na urevabaya makhabuna yo Dilao ekuboiiye naho ekuakhoiye mbalamija.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Niho, ka mheekaso, ekalholhoshi kubirikira are Dekapoli mburi khabuna Yesu emboiiye, vahe vakhabuna vekoie vekamaka. Dekapo nikuba Miang'a ikhado.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mualeta wakwe Yairo na mlage muwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu ekaso kahali bwa mhali wa iziwa. Nau eeumae khakhera he iziwa ifyo igiru la vahe likamjunguluka. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ata ekalita muwe wa vagiru va minda yo vesahe Vayahudi, esewa Yairo. Area muakho Yesu, ekakubibi he masame kuu, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />ekamgogo ekuba, “Mualeta gho mgitutu elaishishishwa. Nikulhawa ulita uremkeiya miharegha kechi, amuru kuu naho akhwa mzime.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Kwato, Yesu ekaso nau. Ifyo igiru la vahe likamliaha ilai limfinhafinha.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ata heelo mlage mrukhao eekuliwe ni sako kwa madamo amiko ikhado na minu, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Eehoiwe ni vakura vakumure. Ka mlage alahati vigi kuu vikhabuna, teuye mira urukhao ukasaisha. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ka mlage areko mburi jakwe Yesu, ekashushumira he ifyo la vahe ekamliaha Yesu kwa mzunngure ekadoa gomae kuu, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Eeboie to kwaite eekutoti he swaho kuu, ite, “Nikudoa bi gomae yakwe Yesu, nineu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Areadoa bi gomae yakwe Yesu, wato oto Sako ikaro kuli, ekakuko ite autiwe urukao kuu. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Wato oto Yesu ekaile ite u kuu jaamli, kwato ekakherii ekaliwesia ifyo la vahe ekalhasu, “Niji edoiye gomae gho?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Vahina kuu vekamba, “Uaho cho vahe vekufinhafinha, kwaahoni ulhasu ite” “Niji enidoie?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Mira Yesu ekakhwa erawesia kira mlha kalo amuakho ka mheemdoie. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Niho ka mlage, ekuile kigi chimlijanyie, kwato ekamliaha Yesu ilai ekusingiza kwa bughu, ekammaya Yesu mamuro naho ekambaya mburi khabuna jo ejiboie. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu ekamba, “Mualeta gho kudaarisha kechi kwa kuuti. So kikulho waau urukao kechi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu areakhwa echeri yo, vekalita vahe kuli he minda ya Yairo mgiru wa minda ya kusahea Vayahudi, vekamba, “Mualeta kechi aaga. Kwaakhoni ucheri muo kharo Mhinya?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Mira Yesu arekoiya kacho veyoe, ekamba mgiru wa minda ya kusahea Vayahudi, “Usibugheno, daraisha bi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Kwato Yesu teedumue mhemhali emliaha, mira ekaso ne Petro, Yakobo ne Yohana mbakhu wakwe Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Vereahe ang'a hakwe Yairo, Yesu ekako nkalasu naho ekavaakho vahe vekuzoisha kwa vukhuye. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesu ekabuu minda, ekavaba, “Kwaakhoni muma nkalasu nakuzo kwa vuhuye? Ya muinyi tegae, etebodi bi!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mira vekamsisi, kwato ekavagu vakabuna gahana, ekavadori aba ne lage kini waka mualeta nahu vahina kuu vakai, vekabuu su hodi ebodijwe ka mualeta. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu ekamdara muharegha hu mualeta egae, ekamba, “Talita koumi!” Chitotie na kuba, “Mualeta, nikuba kaa!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Wato oto ka mualeta ekauma, ekalholhoshi kudaha. Nau eelo miko ikado na minu. Ka mburi jirealijanya, vahe vekamakisha. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu ekavalhiijisha vasimbaiye neri mheka mburi jilijanye, niho ekavaba “Muoni ka mualeta viaghu aa.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etalhiwe are Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu ekahali Kaperinaumu ekaso he muang'a eelherue usewa Nazareti, ekuliahana na vahina kuu. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Muaze wakusaboi nyamalo ureahe, Yesu ekalholhoshi kuhinya heminda vesahea Vayahudi. Vahe vakumure vemkoe cho ehinya vekamaka, vekalhasu, “Ho ya mburi khabuna ejigue le? Emurue kimomo kuila na kuboi mburi giru saya? Sari kuboi vimako vigiru saya?. <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ho, ya sihu esiha mbao, muinyi wakwe Maria, mbakhu wavo Yakobo ne Josefu ne Yuda ne Simoni? He, vaing'inhii kuu mba turedi navo ii hakanu!” Kwato, vekasanuishwa niu.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu ekavaba, Mroto ekoika kira hodi mira tekoika ang'a hakuu, he vabahu kuu nahe vahe va minda kuu .<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kwato Yesu teboiye kimako neri kiwe are, mira ekavakeiya miharegha varukao vesi vakumure na kuvauti. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu ekamakisha kwa kusa darisha kini.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu etavasugha vahina kuu ikado na vanu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kwato Yesu ekaso he vijiji vya sina, ekavahinya vahe. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Niho, ekavabunguru vahina kuu ikado na vanu, ekavakhakha vanuvanu, ekavasugha nakuvao ugiru wa kuyagu mapepo. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ekavaba “Mudori bi mkwaju. Musidori viaghu, ibene neri mhaku. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Oroni makwadoe, mira musichii gomae hali.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Yesu ekavaba kahali, “Minda yo munebawa buuni, musibale ata sari iaze munehali heka muang'a.” <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kira hagi vahe venelhi kumudoria hile kumulhahonha, lini ata na mhumhunhe isong'a he masame kaghu sa kuaija ite Kiumbi niu enevazamari.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kwato vekaso, na vekabirikira ite vahe vayo makusa kini na kuaro. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Vekagu mapepo makumure, na kuvalhomi varukhao vakumure malhoma ya mizaituni na kuvauti.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kigame chakwe Yohana Mzabatija</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Niho, Dilao Herode ereko ka mburi kabuna, kwaite ka mburi jakwe Yesu jeilike kira hodi. Vahe vahali veekuba, “Yohana Mzabatija aaka kuli he kigame! Niu chiro elo u ya kuboi vimako.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Vahali vekaba, “Ya ni Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Vahali vebae, “Ya ni mroto wa Kiumbi sa varoto vahali va azeto.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herode areako ka mburi ekaba, “Ya ni Yohana mzabatija, nimtee mua, aaka kuli he kigame.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Herode niu eajie Yohana mzabatija adarawe, aorowe. Herode eboie to kwa ite eemdorie Herodia ee mlage wakwe Filipo mbahu wakwe Herode. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kwaite kira madamo Yohana Mzabatija eekumba Herode, “Miku ilhiija kumdori mlage wa mbahu kechi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kwato, Herodia eemkeie nkuru Yohana mzabatija, ekadumu kumgaa, mira temuruye, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Kwaite Herode eekumbugheno Yohana mzabatija kwaite ereile ite nee mheedumuwe ni Kiumbi na mhewa Kiumbi, Kwato eekumkeiya ukilaaru asegaiwe. Herode eekudumu kumlakhonha Yohana mzabatija, hata kai eekuhiri he swaho ekufiriti kumlakhonha.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Muaze muwe, Herodia ekaakho kwalhi ya kumgaa Yohana mzabatija, kwaite nee muaze wa kuhulha kuakhoika kwakwe Herode. Herode ekaboi elha giru ekavararika vagiru veaha di kuu, vagiru vakilaaru na madilao va idi la Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mualeta wakwe Herodia areabuu na kura, ekamlhamuijisha Herode na vagalho kuu evararike he elha. Kwato dilao Herode ekamba ka mualeta, “Nilhawa kigi cho udumu, ninekuo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Herode ekamkueiya muo ekamba, “Nilhawa cho udumu, nimuru neri kukhakha hasi udilao gho nikuo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Niho ka mualeta ekaso kuramlhasu lage kini, “Nilhawa kiahoni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Lage mkini ekamba “Lhawa mua wakwe Yohana Mzabatija,”.<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ka mualeta ekakirii nakawe kuso sari he dilao Herode ekamba, “Nidumu waijiji unio mua wakwe Yohana Mzabatija he lungo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Dilao Herode ekabuuwe ni vuhuye, mira temuruye kulhi kwaite eekukeiye muo he vagalho kuu. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Wato oto, dilao Herode ekamsugha mkilaaru kuu aregera mua wakwe Yohana. Mkilaaru ekaso he igereza, ekampaa Yohana mua, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />niho mkilaaru ekagera ka mua he lungo, ekamuo ka mualeta, nau ekamuo lage kini. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Vahina vakwe Yohana Mzabatija vareako ka mburi, vekaso kuraudori msa wakwe Yohana, vekauke za he mbira.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavao viaghu vahe erufu koi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Hu vazasughawe vekakirii vekabunguru vakabuna he Yesu, vekambaiya makhabuna veaboiye na kuhinya. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu ekavaba, “Tusoni hodi hesilo mheturefufu.” Yesu eeyoe to kwaite heelo vahe vakumure veekulita na kuso, chikaboi Yesu na vahina kuu vekabeni madamo ya kua viaghu. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Niho vekakutu mashua vekahaka salaghini, vekaso hodi hesilo vahe.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mira vahe vakumure vareavaakho vekuso vekavaile ite nivo, kwato vekagugulu kuli he miang'a mikabuna, vekavakaeiya kuhe, Yesu na Vahina kuu. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu areadimi he mashua, ekaakho ifyo la vahe, ekavaahoya mbalamija, kwaite veekhwae sa maalu yesilo mzemo. Kwato ekalholhoshi kuvahinya mburi kumure. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Hareahe chamagheri, vahina kuu vekamliaha Yesu, vekamba, “Hodi ii ni roro, na wajiji ni chamagheri.” <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Vaba vahe vaso he vijiji na miang'a iaha sina, varewe viaghu kini. <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Vaoni kune viaghu.” Vahina kuu vekamlhasu, “Ho utudumu turevaweiya mikate ididiwe kwa vikhao vya madini ya mihaku mia nu kalo tuvao vaa?” Ka mihaku migirusha ya kuvaweiya viaghu ya vahe vakhabuna.<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Mulo mikate mime? Soni murewesia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Vareafiriti kuwesia, vekakirii vekamba, “Helo mikate mikoi na samaki nu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Niho Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu vavaba vahe vakukhakhaanye mafyo vazokodi di he mahako mailhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Navo vekazokhodi maifyo ifyo ya vahe mia na vahali vahe hamsini. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Niho, Yesu ekadori hu mikate mikoi na hu samaki nu, ekawesia ana he Kiumbi, ekaviaresia, ekaipu hu mikate, ekavao vahina kuu vavakhakhiye vahe. Wato oto ekavakhakhaya vahe vakhabuna hu samaki nu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Kira muwe ekaa, ekakhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Naho vahina kuu vekadodoli vikhao vya mikate nahu samaki jimerisiye, vekahuti viteju ikhado na vinu. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ka vahe veae ka mikate na samaki veaha vaagiru erufu koi.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etadaha ana he mai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Wato oto Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu vabuu he mashua, vakae kuso Betisaida, madamo ka u ekuvasange ifyo la vahe. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Areafiriti kuvasange hu ifyo la vahe, ekaso he lubwa kuaresi. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ireahe chamagheri, mashua yeaha hasi he iziwa, Yesu salaghu neeu eaha gahana he iziwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ekavaakho vahina kuu cho venyamarika vekuma makasia, kwaite saa yekutavakiriti mzungure. Hareahe sina kulhe, Yesu ekavaliaha vahina kuu, ekudaha ana he mai. Eaha sina kuvatakho, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />mira vareamuakho ekudaha ana he mai, vekatoti ite ni mheelie bamuza, vekama nkalasu. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kwaite vakhabuna veemuakhoe vekabughenisha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Wato oto Yesu ekavaba, “Taani! Ni ani, musibugheno!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Niho ekakutu he mashua hoveaha, na saa ikataa chwi. Vahina kuu vekabubulhuka kweri, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kwaite teveenaile cho Yesu eboie hu mikate. Tevemurue kuile ka mburi.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavauti varukhao are Genesareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Vareatakho iziwa, vekahe idi la Genesareti, ata vekaumati Mashua kini. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Vareali he Mashua, vahe vekamanga muile Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Niho ka vahe, vekaso nakawe he vijiji ikhabuna, vekalholhoshi kuvadori varukhao vebodie he mihasi kini, vekavachii he Yesu kira hodi ho vekoye ite eaha. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kira hodi Yesu esoe, he mbuva, he vijiji na he miang'a, vahe veevakee varukhao he vikhoja. Vekamgogo Yesu neri vadoe bi gomae kuu. Vakhabuna vemdoiye vekautiwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya vakaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mafarisayo vakuwe na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa velie Yerusalemu vekabunguru ho Yesu eaha. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Vekavaakho vahina kuu vakuwe veekua viaghu na miharegha isidumuwe hekuaresi, sa kigi miku ya Vayahudi yekudumu.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Kwaite Mafarisayo na Vayahudi vakhabuna veliaha hucho vehinyiwe ni vakaka kini, tevea kigi sari vaonhi miharegha kini kikulho sakigi chidumuwa he miku ya kumuaresi Kiumbi, <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />vekukhwaa kuli kikhoja tevea kigi neri sari vaonhi miharegha kini. Veekuliaha miku hali, sa chidumuwe kuonhi vikhonho, khore, na vikholhe vya shaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Niho, hu Mafarisayo na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa vekamlhasu Yesu, “Kwaakhoni vahina kechi teveliaha mahinyo ya vakaka kanu? Mira vea viaghu na miharegha isidumuwa he miku ya kumuaresi Kiumbi?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu ekavaba, “Isaya Mroto wa Kiumbi eeyoe kweri arearota mburi kaghu. Sakigi igondiwe he Magondo ya Kiumbi ekuba ite kune valame.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">“Ya vahe, veniko kwa viome kini bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">mira he swaho kini veaha uda na ani.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kuniaresi kini ni tekuvalhaari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">kwaite vehinya miku kini salaghe jo nisivaoe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Kune mwaro miku ya Kiumbi, na kuliaha miku ja vahe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu eerecheri kuvabaya, “Kune mulo kwalhi kulho ja kulhi miku ya Kiumbi kalo kuliaha mahinyo kaghu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Miku yakwe Musa yeebae, mko abaghe ne lage kaghu, naho kira enemuolhu abaghe hile lage kini, chidumuwe agaawe. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Mira kune muhinya ite, kai mheelo kigi cha kumlhaari aba kini hile lage kini, mira eba ite ya kigi ni Korubani,” nisakuba “Kigi ya ni kwa mburi ya kumuo Kiumbi”, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />mwavaboi ka mhevasivalhaari aba kini ne lage kini. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Kanicho muoni miku ya Kiumbi kwa kwalhi ya mahinyo kaghu muyadariye. Kahali helo mburi kumure sakajo muboi.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vigi vimboi mheasimuru kumuaresi Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Niho Yesu, ekalise kahali hu ifyo la vahe, ekavaba, “Nilakhonhani, kune vakhabuna, muile ya mburi jo niyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Tehelo kigi chibuu za he mhekuli gahana chimuru kumboi mheasidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi. Mira, hucho chimli kuli za mhenicho chimboi asidumuijwe he kumuaresi Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Muhe elo malama yeko, nako!<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu na vahina kuu vareliro hu ifyo la vahe na kubuu minda, vahinya kuu vekamlhasu avabaie mburi yaka mtotire. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ho, neri kune temuilie? Ho, temuilie ite tehelo kigi chibuu za he mhekuli gahana chimuru kumboi asidumuijwe he kumuaresi Kiumbi? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kwaite mheekua kigi techimbuu he swaho kuu mira chibuu he maso, naho chitaguwa gahana ya msa kuu.” Kwakuyo to, Yesu ekavitakhoja viaghu vikhabuna ite viraye kuawa naho mheadumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Niho Yesu ekacheri yo ekuba, “Hu kigi chili za he mhenicho chimboi mheasidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kwaite he swaho ya mheheli mitotire mikusa, sa kui na valage va vahe, ugwalo, kugaa, kui na mlage esimke, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />udana, ukusa, mhayo wa mari, lame, luizu, kuolhu, kiburatu, uivile. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ya makusa makabuna yeli za he swaho ya muhe, naka niu yemboi mheasidumuijwe kumuaresi Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudarisha kwa mlage muwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Niho Yesu ekahali ata ekaso sina na muang'a wa Tiro. Are ekabuu he minda we nau tedumue neri hasa mheaile ite eaha ata. Mira temurue kukumatu. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ata heelo mlage eelo mualeta kuu elo ipepo, ka mlage areako mburi jakwe Yesu wato oto ekamangaso ekammaya Yesu mamuro he masame. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ka mlage see Myahudi, eakhoike he muang'a wa Foinike uaha he idi lisewa Siria. Ekamgogo Yesu amgu mualeta kuu ipepo. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu ekamba, “Varo vainyi varongeku. Kwaite si kikulho kudori viaghu vya vainyi na kuyao madie yaa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mira hu mlage ekaba, “Dilao, madie nau, eraa viaghu vimerisiwe ni vainyi vekua.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Kwato Yesu ekamba hu mlage, “Kwa kudarisha kechi, gale ang'a, unemuheia mualeta kechi aliwa ni ipepo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Niho hu mlage ekagale, ekamuheiya mualeta kuu ebodie he mhasi, hu ipepo laamli.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mheesimuru kuyo na kuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Niho Yesu ekali sina na muang'a wa Tiro, kutakhoya Sidoni, kuso Dekapoli ite ni miang'a ikhado kutahoya iziwa Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Are vahe vakuwe vekamgera mheesimuru kuyo na kuko he Yesu, vekamgogo Yesu amkeye miharegha ka mhena amuuti. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu ekamsusughuti ka mhekhakhera hesilo vahe, ekake visatu he malama heka muhe, ekabusu mapae he kisatu na kudoa luanda lwaka muhe. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Niho Yesu ekawesia ana he Kiumbi, ekakhuru saa kwa za ekamba ka muhe, “Efata,” ni sakuba “Lhaika.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Wato oto ka mheekalholhoshi kuko na luanda kuu lukalhamera, ekalholhoshi kuyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu ekavalhiija vasimbaye neri mhemuwe ka mburi. Mira cho evalhiije, nirecho vesaishe kuyo ka mburi. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Vahe vakabuna vekoiye vekamakisha. Vekaba “Eboi kira kigi kikulhosha!” Etavaboi vesiko vako, na vesimuru kuyo vayo!<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etavapasi vahe erufu hai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Heka maaze, ifyo igiru la vahe vekabunguru kahali. Kwaite ka vahe tevelo kigi cha kua, Yesu ekavase vahina kuu ekavaba, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nivakoya mbalamija ya ifyo la vahe, kwaite veaha hawe na ani kwa maaze makai, neri tevelo kigi cha kua. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nikuvasange vaso he miang'a kini vesiae, venelhu mshare are kwalhi, kwaite vahe vahali velie udasha.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Kwato vahina kuu vekamlhasu, “Mira ii ho tuaha ni roro, tuneakho le mikate vya kuvao ya vahe vakhabuna?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Mlo mikate mime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Vekamba, “Tulo mikate saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ekavaba vahe vazokhodi di. Ekadori hu mikate saba ekamgimbika Kiumbi, ekaibendula, ekavao vahina kuu kalo vavakhakhaie vahe navo vekaboi wato. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Veerelo vusamaki esi vukumure, Yesu ekamgimbika Kiumbi kwaka vusamaki, ekavao vahina kuu vavakhakhaie ka vahe. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Kira mheekaa ekakhu. Niho vahina kuu Vekabunguru hu vimerisie vekahuti viteju saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Vahe veae veekurahe erufu hai. Niho Yesu ekavasange vaso, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />nau ekabuu he mashua hawe na vahina kuu, vekatakho he iziwa nakuso hodi hesewe Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo vedumu vimako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matayo 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Are Mafarisayo vakuwe vekalita he Yesu vekalholhoshi kumlhasu, kalo vakamgali, vekadumu aboi lhaa kuli ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu ekako vuhuye he swaho kuu nakuma miraro, ekalhasu, “Kwaakhoni ya ikolwa la maaze ya lidumu lhaa? Kweri nitamubaya neri telikaowe lhaa!”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Niho Yesu ekavaro, ekakirii he mashua, ekaso mlha wa kanu wa iziwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahina vetakwasiwe kuile hucho Yesu ehinya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Vahina kuu veezie kudori mikate mikumure, naho veelo mkate muwe bi he mashua. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu ekavalhiija ekavaba, “Wesiishani mukuke uda na mahinyo ya Mafarisayo na mahinyo yakwe Herode ka mahinyo yeshashija sa ishimbe cho lishashija mdufu wa mikate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Vahina kuu vekalholhoshi kubayana, “Eyo to kwaite tetugerie mikate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu ekaile cho veekubayana, ekavalhasu, “Kwaakhoni mubayana ite temulo mikate? Ho, temuniilie neri? He akiri kaghu jilhatiiwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ho, mulo maila mira temuakho? Mulo malama mira temuko? Ho, temuhulha? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />nireaibendula hu mikate mikoi kuvao vahe erufu koi? He mweburungue viteju vime vya mikate vimerisiye?” Vekamba viteju, “Ikado na vinu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Ekavalhasu kahali, nireikhakha hu mikate saba na kuvao vahe erufu hai, “Mwebungurue viteju vime vya samaki na mikate vimerisiye?” Vekamba “Tweebungurue viteju saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Niho Yesu ekavalhasu, “Ho temnaile ite ani niji?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mheelo maila esiakho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu na vahina kuu varehe he muang'a mgitutu usewa Betisaida, vahe vakuwe vekamgera mheelo maila esiakho vekamgogo Yesu amdoe. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Niho Yesu ekamdara muharegha ka mheelo maila esiakho, ekali nau gahana ya kijiji. Ekambusuya mapae he maila na kumkeiya miharegha he maila kuu, niho Yesu ekamlhasu, “Ho ulo cho uakho?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ka mheelo maila esiakho ekawesia, ekaba, “Niakho vahe mira veakhokana sa mikhatu idaha.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Niho Yesu ekamkeiya kahali miharegha ka mhehe maila. Nau ekalha maila, ekamuru kuakho vigi vikhabuna kikulho. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu ekamsange ekamba aso ang'a kuu, ekumba, “Usirekirii kahali heya kijiji.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petro etamuile ite Yesu niu Masia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Niho Yesu na vahina kuu vekakhwa verecheri so he vijiji vya sina na muang'a wa Kaisarea Filipi. Veaha kwalhi, Yesu ekavalhasu vahina kuu, “Ho vahe veba ani niji?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Vekamba, “Vahali veba ari ni Yohana Mzabatija, vahali veba ite ari ni Eliya mroto wa Kiumbi na vahali veba ite umuwe wa varoto va Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Nau ekavalhasu, “Ho kune muba ani niji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petro ekamba, “Ari niu Masia usughaiwe ni Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Niho Yesu ekavalhiija, “Musiregali kumbaiya mhemburi gho.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo mburi ya kigame kuu na kuka kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Niho Yesu ekalholhoshi kuvahinya vahina kuu ite, “Muinyi wa Muhe edumuwa aatakhoye kharo kumure na kulhiwe ni madilao va Vayahudi, vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa. Edumuwa agaawe mira muaze wa kakai eneka kuli he kigame.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu eevabaiye ka mburi neri kuvamatu, niho Petro ekamdori Yesu khakhera ekalholhoshi kumjoghoiya. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Mira Yesu ekakirii ekavawesia vahina kuu, ekamjoghoiya Petro ekuba, “So mzungure gho, Shetani” kwaite swaho kechi teitoti ya Kiumbi mira itotie ya vahe.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Niho Yesu ekalise hu ifyo la vahe hawe na vahina kuu, ekavaba, “Hekusa mheedumu kuneliaha, edumuwe akulhi salaghe, audori msaraba kuu aniliahe. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwaite mheedumu kuuokola uzime kuu salaghe, eneulhahati, mira mheelhahati uzime kuu kwa mburi gho na kwa Mburi Kulho, eneuokola uzime kuu. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ho, mheeneloja akhoni neri ite eneloja mari khabuna ja idi mira ekalhahati uzime kuu wa maaze khabuna? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ho mheeneowe akhoni kalo aotije uzime kuu? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ikukhwa helo mheneri muwe eneniakhoiya susune ani na mahinyo gho heya ikolwa lilo kui na valage vavahe na makusa, Muinyi wa Muhe nau enemuakhoiya susune, ekuralita he luatame lwa Abaghe ekukhwa hawe na vanyamalo Vanyakhare va Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu ekarecheri vabaya, “Kweri nimubaya, helo vahe vahali veaha ii tevekaga vesinaakho Udilao wa Kiumbi ukulita kwa u.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etakhirii vubasa na kuaku sa kaaze</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Maaze sita areatakho, Yesu ekavadori Petro ne Yakobo ne Yohana, ekaso navo sari ana he lubwa lukulhe hodi veaha salaghini bi. Are Yesu ekakherii kuakhokana kuu, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />gomae kuu jikaaku swe, tehelo neri mhe emurue kujifua jikaaku sato. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Naho vahina vakai vekavaakho Eliya ne Musa varoto va Kiumbi vekuyo ne Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petro ekamba Yesu, “Mhinya ni kikulho nne kufufu ii! Tukwa vuminda vukai kawe ka kechi, kawe kakwe Musa na kawe kakwe Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petro eeyoe to kwaite u na vahinya vaaro teveeilie chakuyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Niho hekaliijanya ilhareno likavaghubika, na kiome chikakoika kuli heka ilhareno ikuba, “Ya ni Muinyi gho nimudumuye, mlhahonhani.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Wato oto ka vahina vekamangawesia kira mlha, mira teveakhoe mhemhali eeaha hawe navo, mira Yesu bi.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Vareakhwa vedimi kuli he lubwa, Yesu ekavalhiija kwa kuvaba, “Musigali kumubaiya mhevigi muakhoe, sari Muinyi wa Muhe ekuraka kuli he kigame.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Hu vahina tevembaiye neri mhekigi chiboiike he lubwa, mira vekakhwa veyo salaghini vekakulhasu vekuba, “Kuga na kuka kuli he kigame niakhoni?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Niho vahina vekamlhasu Yesu vekuba, “Kwaakhoni vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa veba Eliya mroto wa Kiumbi niu edumuwe arongelita?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ni kweri, Eliya mroto wa Kiumbi edumuwa arongelita nakuke mburi khabuna kikulho. Kwaakhoni iji he Magondo ya Kiumbi hegondiwe ite Muinyi wa Mhe enetakhoiya kharo kumure na kulhiwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nimubaiya, Eliya mroto wa Kiumbi alitaa, navo vekamboiya sakigi vedumue, sacho egondiiwe mburi kuu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti mburatu elo ipepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Vareavaheiya hu vahina vahali, vekaakho ifyo igiru la vahe livajunguluke na vahinya vakuwe va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa vekulhasuana navo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Wato oto vahe vareamuakho Yesu, vekamakisha, vekamguguluiya naho vekamholu. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Mweekulhasuana kiakhoni?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mhe muwe hehu ifyo la vahe ekamba, “Mhinya, nitekugeria muinyi gho, elo ipepo limboi asimuru kuyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />kira madamo ka ipepo likumka, litamlhuku di, naka muinyi etaliwa ni mafuo hemuo, etasaho maiki naho msa mzime utadara. Naavagogo vahina kechi valigu ka ipepo mira vakwasiwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune ikolwa lisidarisha! Nifufu na kune sari ami? Ninemulaiija sari ami? Nigeriani ka mburatu ii.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Kwato vekamtii ka mburatu he Yesu. Hu ipepo liremuakho Yesu, wato oto ka mburatu ekalholhoshi kugwegwekisha, kwato ekalhu di na kulholhoshi kunyagharika na kuliwa ni mapaye he muo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu ekamlhasu aba waka mburatu, “Muinyi kechi ekhwae to kuli ami?” Ekamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">“Kuli eemgitutu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kagi kakumure limlhuku he mwalha, hile he mai kalo limgaa. Mira kai umuru kuboi kigi tukoiye mbalamija naho utulhaari! <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu ekamba, kwaakhoni uba “Kai umuru?” Makhabuna emuruika he mheedarisha.<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Wato oto aba waka mburatu ekayoisha ekaba, “Nidarisha! Mira kudarisha gho nikughere unilhaari nidarishe!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu areakho ite ifyo la vahe litamangaburu ho eaha, ekalijoghoya ka ipepo ekuliba, “Ari ipepo umboi mheasiyo na kuko, nikuba umli ya mburatu na neri usireambuu kahali!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ata ka ipepo likaghalaa, likamboi ka mburatu agwegwekishe naho likamli. Hu mburatu ekaakhoika sa uraba etega, na kira mheekaba, “Aaga!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Mira Yesu ekamdara muharegha ka mburatu, ekamlhaari kuuma naka mburatu ekauma.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu areabuu minda vahina kuu vekamlhasu veeaha salaghe, “Kwaakhoni nne twakwasiwe kuligu hu ipepo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ipepo saya telimuru kuli mira bi kwa kuaresi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo kahali mburi ya kigame kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na vahina kuu vekali ata, vekatakhoiya idi la Galilaya. Mira Yesu teedumue vahe vaile ho veaha, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwaite ekutavahinya vahina kuu. Ekavaba, “Muinyi wa Muhe enedariwe na eneotiwe he vahe, navo venemgaa mira muaze wa kakai eneka kuli he kigame.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Mira vahina kuu teveeilie cho eekurota, vekabugheno kumlhasu mburi ya kigame kuu.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niji elo ugiru kuro vakhabuna?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Niho Yesu na vahina kuu vekahe he muang'a wa Kaperinaumu. Vareabuu he minda yo Yesu eedie, Yesu ekavalhasu vahina kuu, “He mwekuyotiana akhoni twai kwalhi?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Mira vahina kuu tevembaie kigi, kwaite kwalhi veekuyotiana ite niji elo ugiru kuro vakhabuna. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu ekazokhodi, ekavabunguru hu vahina kuu vakhabuna ikado na vanu, ekavaba, “Kai mheekudumu kukhwa wa bosi, edumuwa akhwa wa mkhito naho akhwa mnyamalo wa vakhabuna.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Niho ekamdori muinyi mgitutu, ekamuumati hasi hevo naho ekamsamata, ekavaba, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Muhe emdoria muinyi sa ya kwa ilhe gho, enidoria ani. Na enidoria ani mira emdoria Aba gho enisughae.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhe esitulhi eaha hawe na nne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana ekamba Yesu, “Mhinya, twamuakho mheekugu ipepo kwa ilhe kechi. Tukamlhiija kwaite teaha hawe na nne.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Mira Yesu ekaba, “Msimlhiije” Kwaite tehelo mheemuru kuboi vimako kwa ilhe gho naho waata ata ekaniyoiya kikusa. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kwaite, mheesitulhi eaha hawe na nne. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Kweri nimubaya mheekumuo kikonho cha mai kwa ilhe gho kwaite kune muvahe vakwe Masia, kweri enedoria kigi kikulho kuu.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi jimboi mheaboi makusa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Kai hekusa mheenemumboi muwe wa ya vainyi venidarisha aboi makusa, yeseekhwaye kikulho ka mheaorowe isahu igiru la kushaghia he waka kuu na kurabibiwe he bahari. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Kai muharegha kechi ukukuboi uboi makusa, upaa. Nikeba kubuu he uzime wa maaze kabuna weelo na muharegha muwe kuro kubuu na miharegha minu na kubuu jehanamu ya mwalha usiga. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Are helo vunyongole vusiga na mwalha usiga. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kusame kechi kukuboi uboi makusa kupaa. Nikeba kubuu he uzime wa maaze khabuna na kusame kuwe, kuro kukhwa na masame manu na ukabibiwa he mwalha wa jehanamu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Are helo vunyongole vusiga na mwalha usiga. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Kai iila kechi likukuboi uboi makusa, ling'ofule. Nikeba kubuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi ukukhwa na iila iwe kuro kukhwa na maila manu naho ubibiwe jehanamu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Are helo vunyongole vusiga na mwalha usiga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Kiumbi enemtahonhi kira mhehe kharo jitotiye na mwalha, sakigi vahe velhomi mnaro he nihena vesinailhaha he mwalha.”<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Mnaro ni mkulho, mira ukulahati unaro kuu unebutuwe kiahoni kalo ukoiye kahali? Kune Mukhwa sa mnaro ukoiya, mufufu na nhunguru kune salaghe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etahinya mburi ya kudoriana na kuroana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Niho Yesu ekahali Kapernaumu na vahina ekataho chauju ya muharaza Yoridani ekaso he idi la Yudea. Are maifyo makumure ya vahe vekamliaha kahali, nau ekavahinya sakigi eekuraboi.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Mafarisayo vakuwe vekamliaha Yesu vekamlhasu kalo kumgali, “He miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa iradumuija muagiru kumgondia magondo ya kumro mlage kuu?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ho Musa eajie kiakhoni heka mburi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Vekaba, “Musa edumuije muagiru amgondie mlage kuu magondo ya kuroana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu ekavaba, “Musa emugondie ka miku kwaka swaho kaghu ure. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mira kuli cho ya idi lireboiwe, Kiumbi eboiye muagiru na mlage, <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />kwato muagiru enemro aba kini ne lage kini, nau enekwari na mlage kuu, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />navo vanu venekhwa msa muwe. Kwato vo si vanu kahali mira mhemuwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Kwato, cho chikwarijwe ni Kiumbi mhe asichikakanye.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Vareabuu minda kahali, vahina kuu vekamlhasu Yesu ka mburi. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu ekavaba, “Muagiru emuro mlage kuu na kudori mlage mhali, enekhwa edi na mlage esimkuu. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mlage emuro muagiru kuu na kudoriwa ni muagiru muhali enekhwa edi na muagiru esimkuu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavaaresia vainyi vagitutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Vahe veekuramgeria Yesu vainyi vagitutu avakeye miharegha na kuvaboia makulho, mira vahina kuu vekavalhiija. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu areavaaho veboi to, ekasanuiwa ekavaba vahina kuu, “Varoni vainyi vagitutu valita hagho msivatitije, kwaite Udilao wa Kiumbi niwa vahe vetoe saya vainyi vagitutu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nimubaya kweri, mhe esiudoria Udilao wa Kiumbi sa muinyi mgitutu, neri tekabuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Yesu ekavadorika ka vainyi he miharegha kuu muwe muwe, ekavasamata, ekavakeiya miharegha he mia kini na kuvaboia makulho.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhe elo mari edumu uzime wa maaze khabuna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu areakhwa etaso, mhemuwe ekamguguluya, ekammaya mamuro, ekamlhasu, “Mhinya mkulho, niboi kiahoni nimuru kudoria uzime wa maaze khabuna?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu ekamlhasu, “Kwakhoni unise mkulho? Tehelo mkulho, mkulho ni Kiumbi bi. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ureile miku ja Kiumbi, usigaa, usibodi na mlage esi kechi, usigwa, usiyo mlame, uvako aba kaku ne lage kaghu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Ka mheekamba, “Mhinya ka miku khabuna neerejidara kuli uburatu gho.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu ekamuwesia na ekamdumu mira ekamba, “Ubenie kigi kiwe. So uredidi kira kigi cho ulo nacho, mihaku uvao vahuye naari unekukeya makulho ana he Kiumbi. Niho ulita uniliahe.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Hu mheareakoiya to, ekahiri swaho naho ekaso ilai elo vuhuye, kwaite eelo mari kumure.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu ekawesia kira bwa, ekavaba vahina kuu, “Inekhwa ni viure he velo mari kubuu he udilao wa Kiumbi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Vahina vekamashwa kwa viome kuu, mira Yesu ekavabaya kahali, “Vainyi gho, wesiani cho viure he vahe velo mari kubuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kweri chimuruika kimagheri chisewe ngamia kutakho he ihora la singano, kuro elo mari kubuu he Udilao wa Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Vahina kuu vekamakisha na kulhasuana, “He ni muhama iji enemuru kuokolwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu ekavaguya maila, ekavaba, “He vahe techimuruika, mira he Kiumbi chimuruika. Makhabuna emuruika he Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petro ekamba Yesu, “Twaaro kira kigi na kukuliaha ari.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nimubaya, kira mheeroe minda kuu hile vabakhu va kiagiru kuu na va kilage kuu hile lage kuu hile abaghe hile vainyi kuu mbuva kwa kiome gho na kwa Mburi Kulho, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />enedoria vigi vikumure he madamo ya waijiji. Enedoria minda naho vabahu va kiagiru na vakilage naho vamilo na mbuva hawe na kharo naho he madamo elitie enedoria uzime wa maaze khabuna. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Mira vakumure vabosi venekhwa va mkhito na va mkhito venekhwa va bosi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo kagi ka kakai mburi ya kigame kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu na vahina kuu veaha kwalhi kuso Yerusalemu. Yesu eevakaee vahina kuu, vahina kuu vekamaka nahu vahe vemliahie vekako bughu. Yesu ekavadori kahali khakhera hu ikado na vanu na kuvabaya hu yenemlianyija. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Yesu ekavaba, “Lhahonhani, tutaso Yerusalemu, are Muinyi wa Muhe eneotijwa he vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa vekamyoija nakumuoti he vahe vesi Vayahudi, navo venempaaya zamaro ya kuga, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />venemfwa, venembusuya mapae, venemma na ndate naho venemgaa, mira muaze wa kakai eneka kuli he kigame.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ne Yohana vetamgogo Yesu vaowe ugiru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Niho Yakobo ne Yohana vainyi wakwe Zebedayo, vekalita he Yesu, vekamba, “Mhinya tudumu utuboiye cho tunekulhawa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Mudumu nimuboie kigi mina?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Vekamba, “Tudumu utudumuije tuzokhodi hawe na ari, muwe muharegha kechi wa sughano na muwe muharegha wa hina ukuzokhodi he kikire cha Udilao kechi mgiru.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu ekavaba, “Temuilie cho mugogo. Ho munemuru kutakhoia kharo jo ninetakhoiya? Na kugaiwe sacho ninegaiwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Vekamba, “Ee tumuru.” Yesu ekavaba, “Kharo jo ninetakhoiya nakuni munetakhoia wato na kugame cho ninegaiwa na kune munegaiwa wato? <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Mira ani silo ugiru wa kulhoija niji enezokhodi muharegha gho wa sughano na enezokodi muharegha wa hina. Kiumbi salaghuu niu eilie niji azokhodi muharegha wa sughano naho muharegha wa hina hehu evalhoije.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Hu vahina vahali ikado vareako to, vekalholhoshi kuvakoya malhaha Yakobo ne Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Kwato, Yesu ekavase vakabuna hawe, ekavaba, “Mureila ite huvo vetotiwe kukhwa vagiru va idi vevaumaya vahe kwa u, naka vagiru kini veaha ana ya vahe kini. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Mira chisikhwa to he kuni. Mira hu edumu kukhwa mgiru he kune edumuwa akhwa mnyamalo wa vahe vakhabuna. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Muhe edumu kuvakaeti vahali, edumuwe akhwa mnyamalo wa vakhabuna. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kwaite Muinyi wa Muhe telitiye he idi kalo vahe vamnyamarikie, mira elitiye kunyamarikia vahe na kuugu uzime kuu kwa kuvakombo vakumure.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuuti Batimayo elo maila esiaho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Niho vekahe Yeriko. Yesu na vahina kuu hawe na ifyo la vahe vareakhwa veli Yeriko kuso muang'a mhali, mhemuwe esiaho ilhe kuu Batimayo muinyi wakwe Timayo, eezokodie kakera he kwalhi ekulhawa vahe vamlhaari. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Areakoiya ite ni Yesu kuli Nazareti niu eekutakho, ekalholhoshi ekayoisha ekuba, “Yesu muinyi wakwe Daudi, nikoiya mbalamija!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Vahe vakumure vekamjoghoya atae. Mira u ekasaisha kuyoisha ekuba, “Muinyi wakwe Daudi, nikoiya mbalamija.”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu ekauma ekaba, “Mbani alita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Kwato vahe vekamse hu esiakho vekamba, “Kuo swaho, uma, Yesu ekuse.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ekabibi gomae kuu, ekamangauma ekaso he Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu ekamlhasu, “Udumu nikuboye akhoni?” Ka elo maila yesiakho ekamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">“Mhinya, nidumu maila gho yamuru kuakho.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu ekamba, “So, kudarisha kechi kwakuuti.” Wato oto ekaakho, ekamliaha Yesu he kwalhi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etadoriiwa kikulho are Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesu na vahina kuu vareahe sina na muang'a Yerusalemu, vekahe miang'a ya Betifage na Betania yeaha he lubwa lwa Mizeituni. Yesu ekavasugha vahina kuu vanu vamkaeye. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Ekavaaji, “Soni he kijiji chiaha khara he kune. Mukuhe ata, muneheiya muinyi wa mhunda esinaba kuboi nyamalo, eoroiwe, mgeni naho mumgera hagho. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Hekusa mheenemulhasu ite kwaahoni muboi to, mubani, Dilao emdumu naho enemkiriti madamo esimakumure.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Niho vekaso, vekamuheiya muinyi wa mhunda eoroiwe khakhera he balabala, sina na luhige lwa minda. Vareakhwa vemge, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />vahe vakuwe veeumae sina na to vekavalhasu, “Kwaakhoni mumge ka muinyi wa mhunda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Vahina vekavabaiya sakigi Yesu evaajie, na ka vahe vekavadumuija. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Vekamgeria Yesu ka muinyi wa mhunda na vekanagha gomae ana heka muinyi wa mhunda, Yesu ekazokhodi ana heka muinyi wa mhunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Vahe vakumure vekanagha gomae kini he balabala, na vahali vekate matambi vekanagha he kwalhi. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Vahe vekaee nahu veliaha mzungure vekayoisha, “Kiumbi atagolwe! Kiumbi emgimbika hu elitie kwa ilhe la Dilao” <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Kiumbi uboiwe makulho udilao ulitie wakwe dilao kanu Daudi, ee aba kanu, Kiumbi atogolwe eaha anasha!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu ekabuu he muang'a wa Yerusalemu ekaso he minda ya Kiumbi. Ekawesia kira kigi chiaha ata. Mira kwaite nee hachamagheri, ekaso Betania hawe na vahina kuu ikado na vanu.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaubusu mkhatu wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Lhenu kuu, vareakhwa veli Betania, Yesu eelo kela. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ekaaho mkhatu wa mtini kwa uda ulo mahupi makumure, ekarauwesia ite eneakho matunda heka mkhatu. Mira areahe, ehee makhupi bi, kwaite madamo ya tini teyeenahe. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu ekauba ka mkhatu, “Kuli wai na maaze makhabuna tukazesa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Vahina kuu vekamko cho eekuyo ka viome.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaso he minda ya Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Vareahe Yerusalemu, Yesu ekahe he minda ya Kiumbi na kulholhoshi kuvaguguluti vahe vakhabuna veekuwe na kudidi vigi he lugo lwa minda ya Kiumbi. Ekajilhuku meza jahu vahe veekupu mihaku na vikire vya vahe veekudidi njiwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Temdumuije mheadori kigi kuli lugo lwa minda ya Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Niho ekavahinya vahe, ekuba, “Ho magondo ya Kiumbi hegondiwe ite, minda gho inesewe minda ya kuaresia kwa vahe va madi makhabuna. Mira kune mwaaiboi kukhwa mhanga ya vagwalo!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa vekako to, vekalholhoshi kudaa kwalhi ya kumgaa Yesu. Mira veekumko bughu, kwaite ifyo la vahe vakabuna veekumaka ka mahinyo kuu makulho.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Hareahokwa, Yesu na vahina kuu vekali heka muang'a.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya mburi ya mhatu wa mtini uhalae</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Lhenu kuu chalhenu, vareakhwa vetakho kwalhi, vekauakho hu mkhatu weehalae kuli he matambi sari he majindo. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petro ekahulha hu viome Yesu eyoe kwa mburi yahu mtini, niho ekamba “Mhinya, wesia, hu mkhatu wa mtini wo weeubusue waahala!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu ekavaba, “Mdarisheni Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nimubaya ukweri mheeneluba ya lubwa kung'ofole urekubibi he bahari na asikhwa na bughu he swaho kuu, mira adarishe bi ite hu echiyo chinelijanya. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kwato nimubaya darishani, mukuaresi na kulhawa kigi, darishani ite mwaachidoria, na muneowe vikhabuna vyo mulhawa. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Mukumlhawa Kiumbi, Kai helo mheekuboiye kikusa mkaaye na Aba kaghu eaha ana enemukaaya makusa kaghu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Mira kune mukusevakaiya vahali makusa kini neri Aba kaghu eaha are ana tekamukaaye na kune makusa yo muboiye.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etalhasuwe mburi ya udilao kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na vahina kuu vekahe kahali Yerusalemu. Yesu areakhwa edaha he lugo lwa minda ya Kiumbi, vaaresi vagiru, vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa, na vaagiru vazime vekamliaha, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />vekamlhasu, “Uboi ya viome kwa ugiru mina? Ho niji ekuoe ugiru wa kuboi ya mburi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ninemulhasu mburi we, mkunibaya, na ani ninemubaya niboi ya mburi kuli he ugiru wakweji. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Haki nibayani, he ugiru wa Yohana wa kubatija weeliye he Kiumbi hile weeliye he vahe?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Vekalholhoshi kulhasuana, “Tukuba ulie he Kiumbi, enetulhasu, kwaakhoni temweemdarishe Yohana? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Mira tukuba, uliye he vahe, vekavabugheno vahe, kwaite kira mheeeiliye ite Yohana nee mroto wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Niho vekamba Yesu, nne tetuilie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesu nau ekavaba, “Na ani sikamubaye ite niji enioye ugiru wa kuboi ya mburi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mtotiano wa vakurume na mbuva ya mzabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Niho Yesu ekalholhoshi kuyo na vahina kuu kwa mitotiano ekavaba, “Muhe muwe elhae mizabibu he mbuva kuu. Ekakwa lugo, ekatu ihora lakuulea zabibu, ekakwa kiringo. Ka mbuva ekaikodisha he vakurume, ekaso he idi la uda.” <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Madamo ya kudahula zabibu ureahe, elo mbuva ekamsugha mnyamalo kuu he hu vakurume, aremgeria zabibu kuli hehu evakodishe hu mbuva. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Mira hu vakurume vekamdara hu mnyamalo vekamma, vekamguguluti neri vesimuoe kigi. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Niho hu elo mbuva ekamsugha mnyamalo mhali, nau vekamma he mua na kumuboiya mburi ja susune jo vedumue. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Elo mbuva ekamsugha mnyamalo mhali, ka nau vekamgaa. Mzalo mbuva ekavasugha vanyamalo vahali vakumure,vanyamalo vakuwe vekavama, na vahali vekagaawe. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Elo mbuva eemerisiwe ni mhemuwe, ka nee muinyi kuu emdumue. Ekamsugha ilai eba, niraba venemko kwaite ni muinyi gho. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Mira areahe, vekabaiyana, ya niu enepala ya mbuva. Roni tumgaa, kalo ya mbuva ikhwa kanu. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Kwato vekamdara vekamgaa, naho vekambibi gahana yahu mbuva ya mizabibu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu ekavalhasu, “Kwato mzalobuva enesamo?” “Enelita kuvagaa ka vekodishe mbuva vakhabuna na enevao vekodisha vahali ka mbuva ya mizabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ho, temusomiye magondo manyakhare?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">Isaheru lo velhie vazakwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">laakhwa isaheru igiru la msingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Dilao Kiumbi niu eboiye ya mburi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">naka limasha he maila kanu!”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Vaaresija vagiru na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa, na vaagiru vazime, veedumuye kumdara kwaite veeiliye ite mtotiano ka weekuvatakhoa vo. Mira vekako buku ka ifyo la vahe. Kwato vekamro vekaso.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi ya kulhanu kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Niho vagiru va Vayahudi vekavasugha Mafarisayo vakuwe na vahe va ifyo lakwe Herode vaso he Yesu kalo vamdara kwa hucho enechiyo salaghe. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Vekamliaha Yesu, vekamba, “Mhinya tureila ite ari u mhe uyo kweri bi, naho tumbugheno mhe kwaite tuwesia ite u niji. Mira ari uhinya hucho Kiumbi edumu vahe vajiboi. Tubaiye, ho ni miku kulho kumlhanu kodi Kaisari hile hai?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ho, tulhanu hile tusilhanu? Mira Yesu ereile ukusa kini veekutoti, ekavalhasu, “Kwaakhoni mutanitegha? Nigeriani ka igongolo la mahaku wa dinari niliakho.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Vekamgeria ka igongolo la mhaku wa dinari, Yesu ekavalhasu, “Ya basa iaha heya igongolo naya magondo niyakweji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Vekamba, “Ni vwakwe Kaisari dilao mgiru wa Roma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yesu ekavaba, “Yakwe Kaisari muoni Kaisari, na yakwe Kiumbi muoni Kiumbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Navo vekamakishwa niu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mburi ya kuka kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Niho ifyo la Vayahudi lisewa Masadukayo veba ite tehelo kuka kuli he kigame vekamliaha Yesu, vekamlhasu, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />vekuba “Mhinya, Musa mroto wa Kiumbi etungodie ite, kai mheekuga naho teroe muinyi, mbahu kuu edumuwe amdori ka mlage egaiwe ni muagiru, kalo amusaiye mbahu kuu vainyi. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Iji heelo vabahu saba. Wabosi ekadori mlage mira ekaga esiroe muinyi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Niho mbahu wa kanu ekampala ka mlage egaiwe ni muagiru nau ekaga esinasa muinyi. Na wato oto he mbahu kuu wa kakai ekaga esinasa muinyi. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Hehu vabahu vakhabuna saba tehelo neri eroe vainyi. Kalufunda hu mlage nau ekaga. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Iji tubaiye muaze vahe vekuraka kuli he kigame, ka mlage enekhwa mlage wakweji? Tulhasu to kwaite vakhabuna saba veedie nau sa mlage kuu?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu ekavaba, “Kune mwaaoni kwaite temuilie Magondo Manyakare neri umuruisho wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kwaite vegae vekuneka kuli he kigame tevekadori neri kudoriwa, venekhwa sa vanyamalo va are ana he Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Mira mburi ya vaho kuka kuli he kigame, ho temsomie he kitabu chakwe Musa mburi ya kasusuma to kekukha mwalha? Kiumbi embaye Musa, ani ni Kiumbi wakwe Ibrahimu, Kiumbi wakwe Isaka naho Kiumbi wakwe Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Kiumbi si Kiumbi wa vegae mira ni Kiumbi wa vesigae. Kune mwaaoniisha.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miku giru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mhinya muwe wa miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa ekalita, ekavako vekulhasuana. Ekaakho Yesu cho evabae kikulho Mafarisayo ekamlhasu, “He heya miku khabuna, ni hama giru kutakho khabuna?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu ekaba, “Miku giru niyo ya, lhakhonhani kune vahe va Iziraeli! Dilao Kiumbi kanu, niu Dilao muwe bi. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mdumuishe Kiumbi kechi kwa swaho kechi khabuna, na saa kechi khabuna, kwa akiri kechi kukhabuna na u kechi kukhabuna. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Mihake ya kanu niu ya mdumu muaro kechi sakigi ukudumu salaghe. Tehelo mihake mihali migiru kutakho ya minu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Hu mhinya wa miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa ekamba Yesu, “Mhinya waayo kikulho! Ite Kiumbi ni muwe bi neri tehelo mhali mira nireu bi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Kiome ya ni kikulho, kumdumu Kiumbi kwa swaho kechi khabuna na kwa akiri kechi khabuna na kwa u kechi khabuna na kumdumu muaro sakigi ukudumu salaghe ni kikulho kutakho kumguya Kiumbi vivulu vya kulhahawe he mwalha.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu areakho ite ka mheeyoe kwa viugho, ekamba, “Ari tuaha uda na Udilao wa Kiumbi.” Kuli madamo ka, tehelo neri mheegalie kumlhasu Yesu mburi hali.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristo elhoijwe ni Kiumbi ni Muinyi wa kweji?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Kalufunda Yesu areakhwa ehinya he Minda ya Kiumbi, ekavalhasu “Chikwae kimomo vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa veba ite Kiristo ni Muinyi wakwe Daudi?” <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Kwaite Daudi salaghuu, ekukaetiwe ni Saa Mnyakhare eebae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">DILAO Kiumbi eembae Dilao gho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Zokhodi mlha gho wa sughano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">sari nikuravake vankuru kechi di he masame kechi. <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Kai Daudi salaghe emsee Dilao. Kwato, chimuruika kimomo Kiristo kukhwa muinyi wakwe Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu etavaba vahe vakhwa maila na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ifyo igiru la vahe leekumlhakhonha Yesu kwakulhamuiwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu erekhwa ehinya ekavaba, “Khwani maila na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa, vo vedumue kudaha ilai veoroe gomae kulhe na kuholuwe ni vahe kwa miharegha minu hodi hevikhoja, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />naho vedumu kuzokhodi he vikire vya ugiru he minda ja kusahea Vayahudi na kuowe ugiru hodi he elha. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Vetavatati valage vegaiwe ni vaagiru kini kalo vadori vigi kini, kalo kuakhokana vakulho kwa kuaresi kieza. Vahe saya veneowa zamaro kini inekhwa girusha.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kivulu chiguiwe ni mlage egaiwe ni muagiru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Niho Yesu ekazokhodie heminda ya Kiumbi, hewesiana na hodi hekeiwa vivulu, ekaakho cho vahe vegu vivulu kini. Velo mari vakumure veekuke mihaku mikumure, <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />niho ekalita mlage mhuye egaiwe ni muagiru kuu ekagu vigongolo vinu vya shaba tevyeekuye kuweiya kigi kikulho. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu ekavase vahina kuu, ekavaba, “Kweri nimubaiya, ya mlage mhuye egaiwe ni muagiru ebutue kivulu hekikholhe kigiru kutakho vakhabuna vahali. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kwaite vahali vegue kuli hehu vimerisie he mari kini, mira ya mlage mhuye egaiwe ni muagiru, egue vikhabuna vyo elo nau vimlhaari afufu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo mburi ya kuoniwe kwa minda ya Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu areakhwa eli he minda ya Kiumbi, muwe wa vahina kuu ekamba, “Mhinya, wesia masaheru magiru na minda choe makulho!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu ekamba, “Uraakho maminda cho e magiru? Tehelo isaheru linerowe ana he isaheru ihali, mira makabuna yenelhukuwa di.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyamarika na kharo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu eezokhodie he Lubwa lwa Mizeituni luwesiana na minda ya Kiumbi, Petro ne Yakobo ne Yohana ne Andarea vekamliaha hesilo vahe vekamlhasu. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tukugogo utubaye, mburi ya jinelianya ami? Ni lhaa mina ineaija ite ya mburi jaahe sina.”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu ekavaba, khwani maila, hasisa mheemuta. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Vahe vakumure, venelita kwa ilhe gho vekuba, ani niu Kiristo! Navo venevata vahe vakumure. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kune mukurako mburi ja aku, msibugheno. Ya mburi jidumuwe jiliijanye, mira hu mkhito unekhwa teunahe. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Vahe va idi iwe venekwe na vahe vaidi ihali naho udilao muwe unekwe na udilao wa idi ihali. Henekhwa na kukushika kwa idi hodi hakumure na kubuu kela giru. Ya ni kulholhoshi kulhawa kutoe sa mlage ehee sina kusa muinyi.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Mira kune wesiishani. Kwaite venemudara vamuchii Mahakani. Venemuma na ndate ja bulhe are he minda ja kusaheya Vayahudi, munezamariwa he vakaaeti na vadilao kwa mburi gho, kalo muvabaye Mburi Kulho. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Naka Mburi Kulho idumuwe irongebirikirwa he madi makhabuna hu mkhito usinahe. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Mwaradarawe nakuyoijwa, musikuo kharo ite nikiakhoni muneyo. Madamo ekunehe, Mira yoni bi cho muneyo heka madamo, kwaite sikune muneyo mira ni Saa wa Kiumbi eaha za kaghu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mbakhu enemkhirii mbakhu kuu kalo aga, ne aba enemkhirii muinyi kuu. Muinyi nau enevalhi aba kini ne lage kini nakuro vagaawe. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Vahe vakhabuna venemusanuiya kwa mburi ya ilhe gho. Mira enemuru kugumurija sari mkhito eneokoka.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kharo giru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Mukuraakho Kigi chisanuija chiaha hodi hesihakuu naho chiboi vahe vali heminda ya Kiumbi! Niho veaha idi la Yuda vaguguluiye he lubwa esoma naile ya aile ya mburi. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Muhe eaha ana he minda asidimi kubuu minda kuzadori kigi. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Muhe eaha he mbuva asikirii ang'a kuradori gomae kuu. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ni kharo giru he valage velo maso na valage vegosija vainyi he ka maaze! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Aresini ka mburi jisiraa lijanya he madamo ya kiuho! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kwaite madamo ka henekhwa na kharo isiile kuliijanya kuli azeto Kiumbi ereboi ya idi sari waijiji, neri teekalijanye. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Kai Dilao teetepunguja ka maaze, tehelo mheesemuru kuokolwa. Mira kwamburi ya velhoijwe kuu, Dilao aapunguja ka maaze.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Heka maaze, mheekumuba, Wesia, Kiristo! Eaha ii, hile eaha twai! Musimdarishe. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kwaite veneliijanya vahe vekuse kiristo na varoto va lame. Veneboi lhaa na mahirimo kalo vevatati, na ikumuruika na nahu velhoijwe ni Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kwato wesiishani! Nafiriti mubaiya ka mburi khabuna jisinaliijanya.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulita kwa Muinyi wa Muhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Mira ka maaze ya kharo ikuratakho, kaaze kenebutuwe kidughu, na mlhihe teukagu luatame, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />nhondwe nau jinelhu kuli ana, na u jiaha are ana jinekushika. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Niho ata vahe vakhabuna venemuakho Muinyi wa Muhe ekudimi he malhareno ekukhwa na u kumure na luatame lwa ugiru wa Kiumbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Nau enevasugha vanyamalo kuu va are ana he Kiumbi kuvabunguru vahe evalhoje kuli milha mihai ya idi, kuli mkhito wa idi sari mkhito wa are ana he Kiumbi.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtotire wa mkhatu wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Kwato hinani ya kiome kutahoya mkhatu wa mtini. Matambi kuu yekulholhoshi kushuka na kugu mahupi, niho mutaile ite madamo ya buure yaahe sina. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Wato oto, mwaraakho ka mburi khabuna jikulijanya, ileni ite Muinyi wa Mhe eaha afeta. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Kweri nimubaya ikolwa laka madamo telikakhite sari ya mburi khabuna jilijanye. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ana he Kiumbi na idi vinetakho, mira viome gho techikatakho neri.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tehelo eilie muaze wa kulita Muinyi wa Muhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kwa mburi ya muaze hu na kela tehelo neri eilie, neri vanyamalo vaare ana he Kiumbi, neri Muinyi, mira Aba salaghe. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Wesiishani naho mkuke kikulho, kwaite temuilie ka madamo enekhwa ami. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kulita gho kunekhwa sa mhe elie ang'a kuu kuso uda ekuvaroya vanyamalo kuu kuiwesia minda, kira muwe ekumuroiya nyamalo kuu. Niho etamuaji mkilaaru wa luhige akuke kikulho kulaija minda. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kwato, kukeni kikulho kwaite temuilie ite niami mzalo minda enekirii, imuruika ikakwa chamagheri hile naama hile kiamaama, nkuruve ikuzo hile chalhenu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ekunemangalita, asimuheie muie. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Huyo nimubaya kune, nivabaya vakhabuna, kukeni kikulho!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Njama ya kumugaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Heemerisie maaze manu kuhe elha ya Pasaka naya mikate isibutuiwe hamira. Vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuo Musa veekudaa kwalhi ya kumdara Yesu kwa njama na kumgaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Mira vekaba, “Tusiboi ya mburi heya madamo ya elha ya Pasaka, vahe vemuru vaboi kweti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etalhomiwe malhoma are Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu eaha are Betania ang'a hakwe Simoni, hu eutiwe urukho wa lukoma. Areakhwa ea viaghu vya chamagheri, mlage muwe ekalita etie nyhupa yeeboiwe na isaheru lisewa alabasta ka nyhupa yeelo malhoma ewewe kwa mihaku mikumure ekakha ka nyhupa ekamlhomi Yesu ka malhoma he mua. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Vahe vakuwe veaha to, vekabayana, “Kwaahoni ulhalhahaya malhoma ya mihaku mikumure? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ya malhoma yeseedidiwe mihaku mikumuresha, naka mihaku veseowe vahuye.” Vekamjoghoisha ka mlage.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “Kwaakhoni mumnyamarisha ya mlage? Mroni ya aniboiya mburi kulhosha. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Vahuye muaha navo maaze makhabuna, na madamo makhabuna yo mudumu, mumuru kuvalhaari. Mira temkakhwa na ani maaze makhabuna. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ya mlage eniboiye choemuru, ekaeye kulhomi msa gho malhoma kuuboi kikulho muaze gho ninekewe. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nitamubaya kweri, kira hodi he ya idi ho Mburi Kulho ikunebirikirwa, kira mburi jo eboie ya mlage jineyowe, kwato vahe venemhulha.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kuli Isikarioti etadumu kumkhirii Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Niho Yuda kuli Isikarioti, muwe wa hu vahina ikado na vanu, ekaso he vaaresi vagiru kalo amkhirii Yesu hakini. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Vekalhamuishwa kuko ka mburi, vekamkeiya kilagha ite venemuo mihaku. Kwato, Yuda kuli Isikarioti ekalholhoshi kudaa kwalhi kulho ya kumlhi Yesu hakini.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaa viaghu vya Pasaka na vahina kuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />He muaze wa bosi wa elha ya mikate isibutuiwe ishimbe, iaze lo ialu la elha ya Pasaka inegaawe, vahina veemlhasue Yesu, “He Udumu tuso le kalo tukuboiye viaghu vya elha ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Kwato Yesu ekavasugha vahina kuu vanu ekavaba, “Soni he muang'a, are munesahe na muagiru etiiye sange ya mai. Mliaheni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />sari he minda yo enebuu, mremba elo ka minda, “Mhinya elhasu, su gho kwa mburi ya vagalho ho nineaya viaghu vya Pasaka na vahina gho iaha le? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Niho enemuaija su giru iaha ana he igorofa iboiiwe na kukewa kikulho. Kuni vanu tuboieni kaviaghu vya Pasaka ata.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Hu vahina vanu vekaso he muang'a, vekaheiya kira kigi chiaha kikulho sakigi Yesu evabaiye. Kwato vekadaa viaghu vya Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Hareahe chamagheri, Yesu ekahe ekakhwa hawe na vahina kuu ikado heka minda. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Vareakhwa vea, Yesu ekavaba, “Kweri nimubaya, muwe kaghu ea hawe na ani, enenikherii.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Vahina kuu vekadarwa ni vuhuye, kira muwe ekamlhasu, “Dilao, hile ni ani?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ni muwe he kune ikado na vanu, niya eginha mkate he kikhonho hawe na ani. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ni kweri Muinyi wa Muhe enega sakigi hegondiwe he magondo ya Kiumbi, mira kariuwa hehu enemkhirii Muinyi wa Muhe enedarwa ni kharo! Ni keba ka mhesaka esiahoike!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viaghu vya Dilao vya chamakheri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Vakorinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Vareakhwa vea, Yesu ekadori mkate, ekauaresia makulho he Kiumbi ekaubendula, ekavao vahina kuu, ekavaba, “Dorini mua, ya ni msa gho.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Niho ekadori kikhonho chilo divai, ekagimbika he Kiumbi, ekavao vahina kuu, vakhabuna vekawahiya ka kikonho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu ekavaba, “Ya ni sako gho ya iaghano la Kiumbi na vahe isuika kwa mburi ya vahe vakumure. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Kweri nimubaya, sikawaha kahali divai sari iaze hu nineiwaha divai kuale he Udilao wa Kiumbi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Niho vekafaru lufaru naho vekaso he Lubwa lwa Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etayo ite vahina kuu venemro</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, “Kune vakhabuna munegugulu na kuniro, kwaite Magondo Manyakare ite, ninemma mzemo, na maalu yeneparaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Mira nikuneka kuli he kigame, ninemukaeiya twai Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petro ekamba Yesu “Chikhwa vakhabuna vekukuro, ani sikakuro neri.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu ekamba Petro, “Kweri nikubaya wai naama nkuruve isinazo kanu, unenilhi kagi kakai ite tuniilie.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mira Petro ekayoisha ekaba, “chikukhwa kai nidumuwe niga hawe na ari!” Hai sikakulhi. Vahina vahali vakhabuna navo vekayo sato.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaaresi he kaseu kesewa Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:35-46">Matayo 26:35-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Niho vekaso hodi hesewe Getisemane, Yesu ekavaba vahina kuu, “Zokhodini ii ani nitaso twei kuraaresi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Niho ekavadori Petro ne Yakobo ne Yohana. Nau Ekahuyeti he swaho kuu nakunyamarika, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />ekavaba, “Swaho gho ihue uhuye mgiru iaha sina nakuga. Fufuni ii naho kukeni kikulho.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ekadaha hagitutu, ekakama mamuro di ekadudukhu, ekaaresi ekuba, kai chichimuruika, asitakhoiye ka kharo. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ekaba, “Abba, nisakuba Aba gho, heari vigi vikhabuna vimuruika. Unikaiye ya kikhonho cha kharo. Chisikhwa sakigi nidumue ani, mira sakigi ari udumu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Niho ekakhirii hehu vahina kuu vakai ekavahea vebodie. Yesu ekamlhasu Petro “Simoni, waai? Ho Tumurue kumuaresi Kiumbi neri kela we?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Niho ekavaba, “Mukhwa maila naho muaresi kalo msiregaliwe. Swaho idumu kuboi makulho mira msa teudumu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ekaso kuraaresi kahali, ilai ekuyo viome wahuuhu. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Niho ekakhirii kahali ekavahelha vahina kuu vaai, kwaite veelo luireno. Vekabeni kigi cha kumbaya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Yesu areakirii ka kakai, ekavaba, “Murecheri bodie na kufufu? Kani iji, kwaite kela yaahe iji ya Muinyi wa Mhe etaotijwa he miheregha ya vahe vakusa. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Kani! Tusoni! Wesiani hu enikherii elitie.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etadarawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Wato oto Yesu erecheri yo niho Yuda, muwe wahu vahina ikado na vanu, ekahe. Eelitie hawe na ifyo la vahe velo mahamba na viboi. Vesukhawe ni vagiru va muaresi, vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa na madilao. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Iji Yuda emlhi Yesu ekavao lhaa ekavaba, “Ka mhe ninemholu kwa kumdara miharegha niu mumdumu. Mdarani, mumtii he madilao naho mumuwesie asiegugulu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Wato oto Yuda areahe, ekamliaha Yesu nakuba, “Mhinya!” Niho ekamholu kwamiharegha minu kumdara. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Niho, ka vahe vekamdara Yesu vakamuotija he vakilaaru. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Niho muwe wahu veaha mlha muwe ne Yesu eumae sina nau, ekagu sime kuu, ekampaa ilama mnyamalo wa mgiru wa muaresi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Mira Yesu ekavaba, “He mutelita na mahamba na viboi kunidara, sauraba ani ni mgwalo? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Maaze khabuna nereaha hawe na kune nikumuhinya he lugo lwa minda ya Kiumbi, neri temunidaraye. Mira chidumuwe Magondo yaguanye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Niho vahina kuu vakhabuna vekamro, vekagugulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mburatu muwe eeghubike gomae iakhu bi, eekumliaha Yesu. Varemdara, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ekaro hu gome eeghubike, ekaguguglu eseilo gomae.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu eaha he madilao Vayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Niho, vekamtii Yesu he minda ya mgiru wa kirurumo, ata madilao va muang'a, vagiru va muaresi na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa vebungurue hawe. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petro ekakwa emliaha Yesu kwa uda sari he lugo lwa muaresi mgiru. Ekazokhodi hawe na vakilaaru, ilai vekakati mwalha. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Vagiru va muaresi na vahe vakhabuna va ibaraza vekadaa ukweri wa kumdara Yesu kalo vamuru kumgaa, mira teveakhoe. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Vahe vakumure vekamyoiya Yesu lame, mira hucho vemyoe vikalhiana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Vahe vahali vekauma, vekamyoiaya Yesu lame vekuba, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tweemkoe ekuba, nineipu ya minda ya Kiumbi ikwaiwe ni vahe, nae maaze makai ninekwa hali isikwaiwe kwa miharegha ya vahe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Mira neri ite viome kini tevitotie.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Mgiru wa muaresi ekauma he vahe vakhabuna, ekamlhasu Yesu, “Ho ari tulo chakukheriti kwaya makusa makhabuna yeyowe niya vahe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Mira Yesu teandue. Mgiru wa muaresi ekamlhasu kahali, “Ho ari niu Kiristo, Muinyi wa Kiumbi eyoiwa makulho?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu ekamba, “Ani niu. Nakune munemuakho Muinyi wa Mhe ezokhodie mlha wa sughano wa Kiumbi elo u na ekulita kuli are ana.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mgiru wa muaresi ekakhaa gomae kuu eeoroe ekaba, “Tetudumu ukweri mhali wa! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Kune mwaako ya cho emuolhu Kiumbi. Kune mubamo iji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Vakhabuna vekakho ite chiye agaawe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Niho vahe vakuwe vekalholhoshi kumbusuya Yesu mapae, vekamkubika vubasa, vekamma nkundi. Vekamba “Rota ite niji ekumae!” Ata vakilaaru navo vekamma mazokhera.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petro etamlhi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">Yohana 18:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petro areakhwa ereaha hehu lugo lwa minda ya udilao, mualeta muwe eemnyamalo wa mgiru wa muaresi ekalita. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Areamuakho Petro ekukakati mwalha, ekamuwesiisha ekamba, “Naari wato weaha hawe ne Yesu Mnazareti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Mira Petro ekalhi, ekaba, “Siilie naho siilie chouyo,” Niho Petro ekali ata ekaso he luhige lwa kubuiya.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Hu mnyamalo wa kilage areamuakho Petro kahali to, ekavabaiya vahe veumae sina ite, “Ya mhe ni muaro kini.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Mira Petro ekalhi kahali. Kalufunda vahe veeumae to, vekamba petro kahali, “Nikweri ari uaha hawe nau, kwaite ari udie Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Mira Petro ekalholhoshi kujogho na kulapa, “Ani sim'ilie ya mhe mumuyoiya mburi kuu!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Waata ata nkuruve ikazo kakanu. Niho, Petro ekahulha viome vyo Yesu embae, “Nkuruve yesinazo ka kanu, unenilhi kakakhaii ite tuniilie.” Niho Petro ekahiri swaho ekalholhoshi kuzo.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etatiiwe hakwe Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:28-38">18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Chalhenu ama ama vagiru va muaresi, vagiru vazime va Iziraeli na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuoe Musa vekaiseko vamtii Yesu he Pilato. Niho vekamuoro, vekamtii na kumuotija hakwe Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato ekamlhasu Yesu, “Ho ari niu Dilao wa Vayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu ekamba, “Niari uyo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Vagiru va muaresi vekamyoija Yesu kwa mburi kumure. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kwato Pilato ekamlhasu Yesu kahali, “Ho tulo chakukheriti? Wesia ya vahe vekuyoija mburi me.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Mira Yesu teandue niho Pilato ekamaka.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etapaaiwa kuga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kira elha ya Pasaka ikuhe, Vayahudi veekumlhaiya mhe muwe eoroiwe he igereza huye vahe vemdumue, veekuraboi to kira mko. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ka madamo, heelo mhe muwe eekusewa Baraba, eeoroiwe hawe na vaaro veeroe vahe vagaiwe madamo kulhi udilao wa Kirumi. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Hu ifyo la vahe likabunguru na likaso he Pilato likamgogo avaboie sakigi eraboi. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato ekavalhasu, “Ho mudumu nimulhamaie dilao wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato eereila ite vagiru va muaresi vemtiie Yesu heu kwa kumuakhoya luizu.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Mira vagiru va muaresi vekavahimbija hu ifyo la vahe vamgogo Pilato avalhamaie Baraba amro Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato ekalhasu kahali hu ifyo la vahe, “Ho, waijiji mudumu nimboi kiakhoni ya mhe mumse dilao wa Vayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Vahe vakhabuna Vekama gimbe vekuba, “Mmani misumari he msaraba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato ekavalhasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">“He eonie kiakhoni?” Vekama gimbe kahali, “Mmani misumari he msaraba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato eedumue kulilhamuija ka ifyo la vahe, ekavalhamaiya Baraba. Naho ekavaba vakilaaru kuu vamma Yesu ndate naho ekamgu kalo amawe misumari he msaraba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakilaaru vetamfwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27">Matayo 27:27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Vakilaaru vekamtii Yesu he iminda la udilao niho vekavase vaaro kini vakhabuna. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Vekamuoro Yesu ijoho libayu la kidilao, vekaboi ankara ya milhae, vekamuoro he mua. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Vekalholhoshi kumholu kwa kumfwa vekuba, “Tukuholu ari dilao wa Vayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Vekamma na ndate ja muanzi he mua kahali naho vekambusuiya mapae, vekakuboi vemmaiya mamuro sauraba ni dilao kalo vamfwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Vareafiriti kumfwa, vekamgu hu gomae ya kidilao na kumuoro hu gomae kuu. Niho vekamgu gahana he iminda la udilao nakuso nau kalo varemma misumari he msaraba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamawe misumari he msaraba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Veeaha kwalhi, vekasahe na mhemuwe esewa Simoni, mhekuli Kirene, aba kini Alekisanda ne Rufo. Muhe ka eekuli he mbuva kuso he muang'a. Vakilaaru vekamkungumija atii msaraba wakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Niho vekamtii Yesu sari hodi hesewa Goligota, “Nisakuba hodi ha Ifwara la Mua.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Vekamuo divai ikwarianywe na mkha usewa manemane, mira Yesu ekalhi kuiwaha. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Kwato, vekamma misumari he msaraba, vekakaana salaghini hu gomae kuu, kwakuma simbi kalo vaakho ite niji enedori hama. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Madamo ka vekumma Yesu misumari he msaraba nee kela kai hachalhenu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ana he msaraba kuu vekagonda magondo yeba, “Dilao wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Veemmae Yesu misumari he misalaba, hawe na vagwalo vanu, muwe muharegha kuu wa sughano na muhali muharegha kuu wa hina. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ata niho eliijanye hu magondo ya Kiumbi yeba, “Eeboiiwe sa mhe eboie makusa.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Vahe veekutakho ata vekahoho mia kini vekamuolhu Yesu, vekayoisha vekuba “Hoo! Ari weebae umuru kupu minda ya Kiumbi na kuikwa kwa maaze makai, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />dimi iji he msaraba ukukombo salaghe.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Vadilao va muaresi hawe na vahinya va miku yakwe Kiumbi emuo Musa navo vekamuolhu Yesu, vekuba, “Evautie vahali, mira temuru kukukombo salaghe! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ro iji tumuwesie Kiristo elhomiwe malhoma ni DILAO, Dilao wa Isirael, nadimi iji ata he msaraba, na nne tunemuru kumdarisha!” Nahu vahe vanu veemaiwe misumari he misaraba sina ne Yesu navo vekamuolhu.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etaga he msaraba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-30">19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ireahe kela sita chakako idi izime likaghubikwa ni kidughu sari kela kenda. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ireahe kela kenda chakako Yesu ekazoisha, ekaba, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Ata nisa kuba, “Kiumbi gho, Kiumbi gho, kwakhoni waniro?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Vahe vakuwe veeumaye too sina vareako vekaba, “Lakhonani! Etamse Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mhe muwe ekamangagugulu ekaginha isiponji he divai ikala, ekalitunga he ndate ekamuo Yesu awaha. Niho vekaba “Ro iji tuakho kai Eliya enelita kumdimiri ii he msaraba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu ekagu kiome kigiru, naho ekaga.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Mpazia wahe minda ya Kiumbi ukakhaaika vikhao vinu kuli ana sari di. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mgiru muwe wa vakilaaru eeumae ata mbere he msaraba wakwe Yesu areakoia hu kiome chakwe Yesu nakuakho cho Yesu eekuga, ekaba, “Kweri ya mhe ne Muinyi wa Kiumbi!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Heerelo valage to, vekuwesia kwa uda. Heka valage eeaha Maria kuli Magidala, Maria lage kini Yakobo mgitutu wakwe Yose hawe ne Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ka valage veekumlhaari Yesu are Galilaya. Naho heelo na valage vahali vakumure velitie kuli Yerusalemu navo vereaha waata.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etakewe he mhanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:38-42">19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Hareahe hachamagheri, kwaite ne muaze wakukuke kikulho mburi ya muaze wa kufufu, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefu mhe wa Arimataya eekukoiwa kweri he ibaraza la Vayahudi. Nau wangau ekulaa Udilao wa Kiumbi. Ekamsoya Pilato esilo bughu ekamlhawa audori msa wakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato ekamaka areako ite Yesu aaga pere. Ekamse hu mgiru wa vakilaaru, ekamlhasu kai Yesu aafi kuga . <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato areabaiwa nika mgiru wa vakilaaru ite Yesu aaga pere, niho ekamdumuija Yosefu audori ka msa wakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefu ekawe sanda, ekaudimiri ka msa wakwe Yesu, ekauoro sanda ekauke he mbira ituiwe he ikamba, niho ekahinka isahu sari to he luhige lwa mhanga. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maria kuli magidala ne Maria lage wakwe Yose vekaakho to hodi msa wakwe Yesu wekewe.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesu etakirii kuli he kigame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-10">20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Muaze wa kufufu ureatakho, Maria kuli Magidala ne Salome hawe Maria lage wake Yakobo vekawe malhoma kalo vareulhomi msa wakwe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Chalhenu chalhenu muaze wa bosi wa ijuma, kaaze kareali vekaso he mhanga hodi msa wakwe Yesu weekeiwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Are kwalhi vekakhwa velhasuana, “Niji eneratubingirishia hu isaheru igiru he luhige lwa mhanga yo Yesu ekeiwe?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Mira vareahe vekawesia, vekaakho hu isaheru igiru, laabingirishwa kuli to he luhige lwa mhanga ho msa wakwe Yesu ukeiwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Vareabuu he mhanga, vekamuakho mburatu muwe eoroe gomae jiakhu, eumae bwa wa sughano, vekabubulhuka.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Hu mburatu ekavaba, “Musibubulhuke,” “Nireila ite mumdaa Yesu kuli Nazareti, hu emaiwe misumari he msaraba. Teaha ii aka kuli he kigame! Wesia, ii ni hodi ekeiwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Soni iji murevabaya vahina kuu, hawe ne Petro ite, ‘Yesu amukaeiya kuso Galilaya. Are niho munemuaho, sakigi emubaiye.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Niho vekali gahana ya mhanga vekagugulu ilai vezingiza na kumaka. Neri tehelo mhevembaye ka mburi, kwaite veekuko bughu.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etamuliijanyia Maria kuli Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:11-18">20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu areaka kuli he kigame hachalhenu muaze wa bosi wa ijuma, ekarongamguanyija Maria kuli Magidala, hu Yesu eemgue mapepo saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maria kuli magidala ekaso ekavabaiya hu veeaha hawe ne Yesu to esinaga, madamo ka veelo vuhuye na kuzo. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Mira vareako ite Yesu ni mzime naho ne Maria kuli Magidala amuaho, tevedarishe.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalijanyija vahina kuu vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Kalufunda Yesu ekavaliijanyia vahina kuu vanu vekukhwa veso he mbuva ekukwa teakhokana sacho eetoe azeto. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ka vahina vareamuile ite niu, vekakirii na kuvabaiya vaaro kini, mira tevedarishe.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etavalianyija hu vahina kuu ikado na muwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:19-23">20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Miboire 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Kalufunda Yesu ekavalianyija vahina kuu ikado na muwe to veekua viaghu. Ekavajoghoa kwa kusaadarisha he swaho kini na kusaavadarisha hu veebaye ite Yesu aaka kuli he kigame. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Kwato ekavaba, “Soni he madi makhabuna murebirikira Mburi Kulho he kira kiwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Muhe edarisha na kubatijwa eneokolwa mira mheesikadarishe eneowa zamaro. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ya lhaa jineboiwa ni vedarisha, kwailhe gho venegu mapepo na kuyo kiome kikua. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Vekudara bome hile vekuwaha kigi chigaa, techikavahiri. Venevakeiya varukao miharegha kini na kuvaaresia, veneu.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etadoriwe kuso ana he Kiumbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Miboire 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Dilao Yesu areafiriti kuyo na vahina kuu, ekadoriwe kuso ana he Kiumbi naho ekazokhodi mlha wa sughano wa Kiumbi . <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Niho hu vahina vekaso kuvabirikiria vahe Mburi Kulho kira hodi. Dilao nau ekaboi nyamalo hawe na vahina kuu nakuaija ite kiome kuu nichakweri kwa lhaa jiliahane na kiome kuu.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>